INSERT INTO `ads` VALUES (9,'Toyota Car for Sale $3000','98 Toyota Corolla, 10,000 miles, new tires, run very well. asking price $3000.','phone: 718-372-9745\r\n\r\nemail:caith01@rocketmail.com',1,'2011-10-19 13:50:21','tom','For Sale'),(10,'Used Computer DELL DIMENSION E800 For Sale $300','CPU: Intel Core 5\r\nMemory: 4gb\r\nHarddrive: 500gb\r\nMonitor: Dell 22\"\r\n\r\nWindow Vista\r\n\r\nRun very well since I bought it. It never crash at all. It is great  for documentation and internet browsing. It is good for play games if a new video card is plugged in.\r\n','email:computer@mail.com',1,'2011-10-19 14:05:33','tom','For Sale'),(11,'HTML Developer','know how to get around with html.\r\n<br/>\r\ncan use css to control the layout and fonts\r\n<br/>\r\nknow how jquery very well\r\n<br/>\r\ncreative\r\n<br/>\r\nknow how to cut images\r\n\r\n<br/>\r\nlike to train youself  to handle the data from the backend.\r\n<br/>\r\n\r\nfocus and move quickly','thomas@hooni.org',1,'2011-11-03 04:05:37','Thomas','Jobs'),(12,'$200 One car garage available for rent (Brooklyn, NY)','One car covered garage available for rent. Looking for $175-$200/month, open to discussion. Space is clean and recently painted. Automatic garage door. Garage is completely separate from owner\'s house. Current owner does not own vehicle so driveway has free and open access to garage. Image included is of actual garage space.\r\n\r\nOwner would prefer that renter uses space for car, rather than storage. ','If interested, contact Frank at 203-637-2511. ',0,'2011-11-21 04:29:16','tom','For Rent'),(13,'2br - Downtown Bridgeport','We have great 2 bedroom apartments available to those who want a lifestyle more interesting than the suburbs but less hectic than a big city. Rental rates $1,368 to $1,676 per month plus electric. We are close to the ferry, train/bus terminal, and highways. Off-street parking is also available. All apartments have hardwood floors, granite countertops, and walk-in closets and come furnished with stainless steel finish kitchen appliances, a washer, and a dryer. Join the residents already enjoying Downtown\'s growing and entertaining mixed use neighborhood.','For more information, please call 203-366-3766',0,'2011-11-21 04:40:49','jessica','For Rent'),(14,'Nintendo DS Games - $5(New York)','Holiday Gifts- DS Games - New Condition - Great Gift\r\n<p/>\r\nGreat DS Games in original boxes, with original instruction booklets only $5 each. All 11 for $45\r\n\r\n<p/>\r\nHanna Montana Music Jam\r\nHigh School Musical Makin\' the cut\r\nDrawn to Life the next chapter\r\nBrain Age2\r\nHanna Montana\r\nChallenge me Brain Puzzles\r\nCatz\r\nKung Fu Panda\r\nNinten Dogs\r\nAnimal Plante Vet Life\r\nFasion Designer','Phone: (718)880-9989',0,'2011-11-21 04:51:17','jessica','For Sale'),(15,'3 Bedrooms House for sale(FL)','This is a lovely 3/2 in a quiet wooded neighborhood. Wide tree lined streets, nice corner fenced in lot with lots of shade trees. Excellent location route 408, 419 and the Florida Turnpike. Minutes from West Oaks Mall and Downtown Orlando. \r\n<p/>\r\nPrice: $124,900','Call: (407) 244-5900',0,'2011-11-21 15:25:38','jessica','For Sale'),(16,'House for sale ORLANDO, FL 32811','This home is in \"pre-foreclosure\". The owner is in default. As this is the period prior to the home lapsing into official foreclosure, the owner and lender are both interested in avoiding that costly scenario. Buyers are often able to find great deals here. This is a 1,342 square foot home with 3 bedrooms and 2 baths. We believe the home to worth approximately $86,000.','Call 405-235-6243',0,'2011-11-21 15:33:02','jessica','House'),(17,'Frog for Sale - $5 (Brooklyn)','It is great pet. It is easy to take care of. Usually he just goes about his own activities and doesn\'t require much attention. If you have a garden with the mosquito, it is great to have him around to eat all of them.','pick up only',0,'2011-11-21 15:40:38','jessica','For Sale'),(18,'Fishing rod ( brand new)','Brand new fishing rod, never used.\r\n\r\nBought it for $100, like to sell it for $50.','email: john@sina.com',0,'2011-11-21 15:48:07','jessica','For Sale'),(19,'4 Star Hotel in Sea World - Intl. Drive - Convention Center Area for $76 a night','$76 a night for a 4-star hotel in Orlando, FL.\r\n\r\n<p/>\r\nAll rooms will accommodate up to 2 adults. Requests for bed types (King, Queen, 2 Doubles, etc.) or other special needs (including preferences for smoking or non-smoking rooms) should be requested through your confirmed hotel and cannot be guaranteed. ','call:407-235-6512',0,'2011-11-21 16:08:09','jessica','Travel'),(20,'For All Your Computers Troubleshooting (Bronx/Brooklyn/Manhattan)','<li>We can help you with the following problems</li>\r\n\r\n<li>* Windows Password Recovery</li>\r\n\r\n<li>* PC Repairs & Upgrades</li>\r\n','Call Kenny @ 347 317 1611',0,'2011-11-21 16:10:57','jessica','Company'),(21,'Innovative Website Solutions','<li>Are you looking for a modern, interactive and highly professional website that stands out from the sameness on today\'s Internet?</li>\r\n<li>We can help you.</li>\r\n<li>We are a team of professional web designers and online marketing specialists with more than 10 years of experience.</li>\r\n<li>We make all kinds of websites from informational to eCommerce using the very-latest technologies. Our affordable services include:\r\n• Custom website designs\r\n• Logo designs\r\n• Website development\r\n• Domain/Hosting Services</li>\r\n<p/>\r\nFind out the difference we can make for you. For a free consultation:\r\n\r\n','Please Call:1-(646) 248-6165',0,'2011-11-21 16:15:57','jessica','Company'),(22,'All In One Printer (Brother) - $50 (Brooklyn)','Brother MFC 7340 laser printer - Fax / copier / printer / scanner.\r\nGreat condition. \r\n\r\n<li>faster printer for low cost per paper on laser</li>\r\n<li>easy to fax, just put down the paper on the trace dial the fax number</li>\r\n<li>two ways copy</li>\r\n<li>color scanner: you can scan picture or text page to different kinds of format you like.</li>','Email: melissa@hooni.org',0,'2011-11-21 16:58:11','melissa','For Sale'),(23,'WebCam-Logitech Pro - $30 ','webcam logitech pro for $30. I only use this once. I will send you the whole package manual.','call: 646-956-6598',0,'2011-11-21 17:01:29','melissa','For Sale'),(24,'$130 large room. Funished(Brooklyn)','<li>large room available now</li>\r\n<li>1st floor share kitchen/bath</li>\r\n<li>no pets</li>\r\n<li>single people only. No couples</li>\r\n<li>located on stegman parkway</li>\r\n<li>light rail is nearby</li>\r\n','Phone: 201-448-7777 ',0,'2011-11-21 17:15:39','melissa','For Rent'),(25,'Silver knives and forks','3 silver knives\r\n3 silver forks\r\n\r\n$100','email: melissa@hooni.org',0,'2011-11-21 17:20:57','melissa','For Sale'),(26,'Penguin Cooler - $15','Penguin Cooler for your house that holds ice or can also help keep food warm as well. Let me know if your interested in this product.\r\n','jame@yahoo.com',0,'2011-11-21 17:23:07','melissa','For Sale'),(27,'2005 Buick Sedan - $5000 (Bensonhurst, Brooklyn)','Selling a 2005 Buick Lacrosse has only 90000 miles.\r\nit\'s Silver exterior and Gray Cloth interior.\r\nPower windows, Locks, Mirrors, Automatic Transmission, Automatic Lights, ICY COLD A/C.\r\nNever had an accident, Clean interior and Exterior...\r\nRuns Smooth and Great!!.Driven in PA.\r\nIt\'s Reliable as Honda Accord, Toyota camry, cadillac, hyundai, sonata, elantra...\r\nPlease call me for questions.','call:201-256-1000',0,'2011-11-21 17:26:32','melissa','For Sale'),(28,'2005 Toyota Sienna Minivan- $7000 (Bensonhurst, Brooklyn)','<li>selling a 2005 Toyota Sienna CE with 150,000 miles.</li>\r\n<li>all the miles from highway, Engine and Transmission is Running Powerful and Smooth.</li>\r\n<li>Runs Quiet, No Problem, No Warning Lights!!</li>\r\n<li>The car is good for another 100k miles!!</li>\r\n','call: 347-569-1300',0,'2011-11-21 17:29:05','melissa','For Sale'),(29,'Production Worker / Lab Assistant (Brooklyn)','This is a career opportunity to join a continuously growing beverage company in Brooklyn, NY (Monday-Friday):\r\n<p/>\r\nJob Purpose: To support our production operation by fulfilling the following tasks:\r\n\r\n<li>Preparing a batch: Weighing out raw materials, adding them to a batch in a certain order and timing, according to a formula. Once a batch is ready, taking QC measurements (pH, Brix etc.)</li>\r\n<li> Supporting the production line (routine tasks: bottling, Sealing, Packing etc.) </li>','Resume to: jessica@hooni.org',0,'2011-11-21 17:33:03','melissa','Jobs'),(30,'Used Giant Adult Bike For Sale','This is used brand Giant bike. All the tires and brakes are in good condition. I bought it when I was in college. It have been stored in the garage for a while. It looks and run great.\r\n\r\n<p>Asking $50</p>','caith01@rocketmail.com',0,'2012-05-02 13:19:03','tom','For Sale');
