INSERT INTO `blog` VALUES (2,2,'Apache + Tomcat are free and register a website name only cost $8 a year. By comparing of opening a regular store with rent about $2000-$3000 monthly with opening a website, it is a good deal to open a store online.',1,'2011-11-07 18:25:09'),(8,2,'You can down Apache HTTP web server here:\r\n\r\nhttp://httpd.apache.org/download.cgi',0,'2011-11-07 19:01:34'),(9,2,'You can download Tomcat Server here: http://tomcat.apache.org/\r\n</br>\r\nYou can use java servlet on Tomcat server to handle the users\' requests.\r\n</br>\r\nYou can implement your whole application in java and put it online with Tomcat.',0,'2011-11-08 02:24:18'),(14,7,'When you child catch the cold, checking his/her fever every 3/4 hours is necessary. Usually they have the fever when they catch the colds. Fever can cause other illnesses. ',0,'2011-11-23 15:33:34'),(15,8,'It will surprised you how much dirt stuck inside of your pc after let it sit over there for one year.',0,'2011-11-23 15:55:56'),(16,9,'Hanging a multiplication table on the wall in your children room really help them to memorize the table faster.',0,'2011-11-23 17:07:39'),(17,10,'Write a journal can help improve your writing for a long run.',0,'2011-11-23 18:43:38'),(18,11,'Installing a ceiling fan can keep the whole room cool down and save quiet of bit on the electrical bill.',0,'2011-11-23 18:54:57'),(19,12,'multiple player games are so cool, please do not additive to it',0,'2011-11-23 19:14:43'),(20,13,'In order to open an online store, first thing need to do is to register your store name, it usually cost about $8 for one year.',0,'2011-11-23 19:59:21'),(21,14,'<ul>\r\n<li>Use the internet to pay all you bills, not more stamps, and late payments</li>\r\n<li>Buy same item with deep discount</li>\r\n<li>Search the topic you like</li>\r\n<li>connect all your friends</li>\r\n<li>send messages around</li>\r\n<li>read stories online too</li>\r\n</ul>',0,'2011-11-23 20:04:47'),(22,15,'Pictures are taken by a photographer can be put on the frame in the wall.',0,'2011-11-23 20:16:15'),(23,16,'If you changed your own car moto oil, you have to recycle the oil to the fixed garage. By law, they have to take from you without any questions.',0,'2011-11-23 20:22:40'),(24,17,'\r\n\r\nAs the fall wind blows through the capital city, it is time for me to write a letter with my deep thoughts to my far away family. Because of in rush, there are so many things to write and afraid that something forget to say. Always thinking about to open the letter again to add more things to it before I drop it off to the mailman. \r\n',0,'2012-01-30 22:48:39'),(25,17,'秋思\r\n\r\n洛阳城里见秋风, 欲作家书意万重. 复恐匆匆说不尽, 行人临发又开封.',0,'2012-01-30 23:00:52'),(26,17,'Our country have been destroyed and occupied, but the mountains and rivers still there for us to use.  The city is empty and a lot of grasses have been grew all over everywhere. A high pitch sound from the birds in the sky usually is a great muse, but right now it feels like a ghost’s loud screaming from the sky.\r\n\r\n',0,'2012-01-30 23:01:58'),(27,17,'春望<br/><br/><br/>\r\n\r\n囯破山河在, 春城草木深. 感时花贱泪, 恨别鸟惊心.\r\n',0,'2012-01-30 23:26:44'),(28,18,'After you register on our website, you will able to post on our website for all the components, such as creating your own news, sharing how to cook foods with others. You ever can do advertisement for free. You also can create your blog.',0,'2012-02-07 15:26:04'),(29,18,'Our site supports post messages in different languages. For example, you can post English message or Chinese message in the news. Mixed two languages in the same message is also fine too.',0,'2012-02-07 15:34:55'),(30,18,'Our site also works perfectly fine on the browser in your phone. This had been tested on the Safari in Iphone or Ipod touch already. For the Nokia phones, it works fine on the English version too. You don\'t have to download any apps, just type the url: www.hooni.org.',0,'2012-02-07 15:59:38'),(31,18,'Add encryption on the register and login pages to protect users\' information. We do double encryption on our users\' data. No other parties can see your registration or login information except you and our server.',0,'2012-02-07 16:05:51'),(32,18,'Setup the footer for this site, so that the users know how to contact us or what we up to.',0,'2012-02-07 16:08:04'),(33,19,'Coconut Cream: It is concentrated from cream milk and can be found in supermarkets.',1,'2012-02-27 14:08:16'),(34,19,'Condensed Milk: It is very rich in flavor and very smooth in taste and can be found in supermarkets.',1,'2012-02-27 14:11:31'),(35,19,'Gelatin: It is a pure, unsweetened, and unflavored substance and also called jelly powder. With the chewy taste, it is a good ingredient for making jellies.',1,'2012-02-27 14:15:52'),(36,19,'Red date: It is very effective in enhancing stomach and spleen, increasing blood, and strengthening the vitality. It can be bought from Chinese supermarkets.',1,'2012-02-27 14:18:59'),(37,19,'American Ginseng (Panax quinquefolia): It is very effective in strengthening the body and delaying aging. It can be bought in Supermarkets.',1,'2012-02-27 14:23:08'),(38,19,'Medlar(Kou Chi): It is very effective in nourishing kidneys and livers, strengthening eyes, beautifying skin, and moistening lungs. It can be bought in Chinese grocery stores.',1,'2012-02-27 14:27:40'),(39,19,'Honey: In addition to the sweetened taste, there is a unique flavor of it. It is very good BBQ.',1,'2012-02-27 14:32:04'),(40,20,'Tomato: Taste a little source',1,'2012-02-27 14:43:44'),(41,20,'Broccoli',1,'2012-02-27 14:55:28'),(42,20,'Cauliflower',1,'2012-02-27 14:57:29'),(43,20,'Leek(Asia): It good ingredient for cooking dumplings. ',1,'2012-02-27 15:01:01'),(44,20,'White Vegetable(Bok Choy)',1,'2012-02-27 15:03:22'),(45,20,'Bok Choy(Grow in Winter)',1,'2012-02-27 15:06:28'),(46,20,'Parsley: Widely used in Asian Cooking, especially for soup. Parsley helps to lower cholesterol and blood pressure, to prevent cancer and to promo