n\r\n</table>',0,'2012-04-27 21:48:49'),(85,14,'<h3>Pay you bills online</h3><p>\r\nMost of big banks even the small banks offer free internet banking these days. It really convenient to just pay your bills online as long as you have a checking account. The fee is free.\r\n</p><p>\r\nYou also go to you electric company or gas company\'s web site to pay your bills too. Of course, the fee are free too. \r\n</p><p>\r\n\r\nYou can pay credit cards\' bills online too. Just log into your account on the credit card companies\' websites, you can use your checking account to pay off your bill without any fees.\r\n\r\n</p><p>If you are not sure about how to pay your bills online, and you have the internet connection, you can call your companies, most of them will teach you how to that steps by steps.</p>',0,'2012-05-02 13:12:40'),(86,14,'<h3>Searching Online</h3>\r\n<p>That is right, the internet is big these days, and lot of contents. We can consume all the information by our lifetime, it is same like we can not finish reading all books in the library. We usually like to find out what we like to know at the moment. Searching on the internet is a great way to find out whatever you like to know.  \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nSearching in English: <a href=\'http://www.google.com\'>www.google.com</a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nSearching in Chinese: <a href=\'http://www.baidu.com\'>www.baidu.com</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nUsually, all these searching companies store the information by keywords. As long as you type in the words related to your topic, most of time you find out your answer by changing the input words a few times. \r\n</p>',0,'2012-05-02 13:13:01'),(87,24,'美国还是最富有的国家,我说的是最多富有人的国家,而且非常富有, 当然不是说政府. 非常可笑, 富人把政府的钱变为己有, 再逼使普通的民众去还.',0,'2012-05-02 13:26:15'),(88,25,'过去的三十年,中国发展的真不错, 最起马能使一个从充满饥饿的国家, 到一个生活过得去, 同时又不受外来势力压迫的国家. 我是亲眼见到同感受到这些变化的, 三十年前, 人们生活非常艰苦, 能吃饱还有问题, 能穿上一对新鞋就非常高兴. 现在就不用 多说了, 基本生活都满足. 不要忘记了, 中国是农民的天下, 老百姓才是主人. 不信, 翻开一九四九年十月一日, 毛泽东回应人民时说的那句话: \"人民万岁\". \"土改\", \"资产阶级斗争\", \"文化大革命\", 那一样不是为农民着想的呢？ 最近总是听到一些新闻关于某某地方反对政府是因为土地挣夺. 这些事情看起来很简单. 可是很相似皇朝时代的土豪与地方官互 相勾结来压迫老百姓.',0,'2012-05-02 13:27:44'),(89,18,'Make the default home page same as the domain name, for example, www.hooni.org will have www as the default home page.',0,'2012-05-02 13:37:52'),(90,18,'Add zoom feature to the food page, so that the user able to zoom in to see the clear shot of the dish.',0,'2012-05-02 13:38:45'),(91,17,'<br/>\r\n										<p>悯农诗</p>\r\n\r\n<br/>\r\n<br/>\r\n锄禾日当午，汗滴和下土。谁知盘中餐，粒粒皆辛苦\r\n<br/>\r\n<br/>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWorking on the farm in the middle of day with the sun in the middle of sky, the sweat dripping off my chin one follow another into the field. Does anyone care where the foods on the dinner table came from? Every piece of them came from the hard working farmers.  \r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIt just remind us that we should not waste any food or resources, all of them come from hard working people.\r\n\r\n\r\n</p>',0,'2012-05-02 13:43:38'),(92,17,'回乡偶书\r<br />\r<br />少小离家老大回，乡音无改鬓毛衰.　\r<br />儿童相见不相识，笑问客从何处来.\r<br />\r<br />\r<br />I left my hometown when I was little and went back there for visiting when I was old after many years of working. \r<br />I still speak the same dialect like they speak, the only different is that I have a lot of white hair. \r<br />There are many children in the town and say hero to me, but I don\'t know any of them. \r<br />They ever asking where I am coming from?\r<br />\r<br />\r<br />\r<br />\r<br />I guess a lot of immigrants have this kinds of feeling when they visiting their hometown again.\r<br />\r<br />相信很多移民会身同感受.',0,'2012-05-03 13:28:06'),(93,17,'将进酒\r<br />\r<br />人生得意须尽欢，莫使金樽空对月。\r<br />天生我材必有用，千金散尽还复来。\r<br />\r<br />Life should live as exciting as possible, don\'t let other thing bother you and behave like someone whom is sitting on the bench and keep sighing by looking at the moon for the whole evening. Everyone is unique and has skills when they come to this world, there must a place for my expertise. Money is just an illusion, I can get it back after I spend thousands and thousands of them. ',0,'2012-05-18 02:32:09'),(94,18,'Move the food component to a new domain food.hooni.org, all the links related to food should connect to the new home page. For example, <a href=\'http://food.hooni.org/foods?fid=46\'>http://food.hooni.org/foods?fid=46</a>.',0,'2012-05-26 13:23:52'),(95,18,'The users also able to add recipes to a menu so that they can cook later in the new food home page',0,'2012-05-26 13:29:02'),(96,18,'The registered users also able to save their favorite recipes so that they can see them everytime they login.',0,'2012-05-26 13:31:54');
