INSERT INTO `food` VALUES (26,'Juice Clams','One of great seafood dish. It does not need a lot of effort to cook it. It only need a few spices to cook it. It really tasty. Especially for those who love seafood.',1,'2011-10-08 18:55:33','2011-10-08 18:55:33','tom',2),(27,'Fry Vegetable','Fully cook vegetable with the crunch. It is tasted like cheese but it is vegetable.',1,'2011-10-08 19:03:46','2011-10-08 19:03:46','tom',7),(28,'Jello Eggs','It is Jello. It is tofu. It is egg. It is made out of egg buy not sweet. It taste like tofu softness and your mouth or tongue feel like you just ate a a piece of steak.',1,'2011-10-08 19:07:22','2011-10-08 19:07:22','tom',0),(29,'Solid rice dumpling','It is great dish for the cold weather. It is a soup with rice dumpling. When you eat it, the dumplings are like soft gum, they are needed a little bit of chewing. It also feels like eating Macaroni.',1,'2011-11-02 23:05:12','2011-11-02 23:05:12','tom',1),(30,'Boiled Egg','Boiled egg is a very simple dish. Almost everyone knows how to cook it. Still it could be cooked differently and taste differently. Since eggs are one of healthiest foods, we like to describe how to cook it here.',1,'2011-11-10 03:05:11','2011-11-10 03:05:11','tom',0),(32,'Bubble Tea','The sago is gummy, smooth and chewable. Drinking tea along is the kind of lonely. This tea let you taste the tea with milk and at the same time let you have some chewing on the squeezed sago.',1,'2011-11-10 23:27:47','2011-11-10 23:27:47','jessica',3),(33,'Coconut Tea','Coconut juice is tasted well along already. Mixing it with tea, make it tasted ever better, especially during summer.',1,'2011-11-10 23:45:06','2011-11-10 23:45:06','jessica',3),(34,'Sago & Taro Milk Sweet Soup','It is great for a mid-night snack. It is smooth and juggling. ',1,'2011-11-20 04:56:30','2011-11-20 04:56:30','tom',1),(35,'Eggwhites Fruit Smoothie','It is fruit jello, but it is made out of egg. ',1,'2011-11-20 05:38:14','2011-11-20 05:38:14','tom',0),(36,'Tomato Egg Soup','Sweet and sour soup. It is great dish to jump start your appetite.',1,'2011-11-20 06:22:07','2011-11-20 06:22:07','tom',1),(37,'Turkey Bacon','Bacon is one of American most traditional food. All the people in my family love it, especially my children. They always ask me to cook bacon for them in the morning. This dish is bacon, but it is turkey bacon. I usually cook regular bacon which is made out of pork. Accidentally, I picked up a pack of turkey bacon from the supermarket one time and tried it. It is tasted almost same like regular bacon, but with less salty and oily.  ',1,'2012-02-25 19:07:50','2012-02-25 19:07:50','tom',5),(40,'Fry vegetable leeks with eggs','The dish is very simple to cook and very common in Chinese food. It has the mixed taste of vegetable and egg. The vegetable in this dish is one kind of leeks you can find inside of dumpling.\r\n',1,'2012-02-25 23:25:14','2012-02-25 23:25:14','tom',7),(41,'Regular Bacon','Bacon is one of American most traditional food. All the people in my family love it, especially my children. They always ask me to cook bacon for them in the morning. Here we go, it is all about bacon.',1,'2012-03-07 04:09:08','2012-03-07 04:09:08','tom',5),(42,'Steak','There are many ways to cook a nice steak. We like to show you how to cook a juice garlic steak',1,'2012-03-07 05:11:57','2012-03-07 05:11:57','tom',5),(43,'Cream noodle with dry shrimps','It is a simple noodle dish, quick and easy to cook. If you like chicken noodles, you would like this.',1,'2012-03-08 04:02:25','2012-03-08 04:02:25','tom',1),(44,'Fry Winter Melon','It not sweet or sour, it is soft and juice. It tastes like cheese, but it is vegetable.',1,'2012-03-17 05:04:22','2012-03-17 05:04:22','tom',7),(45,'Fry Napa Cabbage','Another healthy vegetable dish. It is simple, easy and quick to cook. ',1,'2012-03-20 17:34:11','2012-03-20 17:34:11','tom',7),(46,'Fresh rice noodles with Beef','Flat fresh rice noodle with little chewing, when it is mixing with beef, you feel that the whole bowl of noodles will taste like beef.',1,'2012-03-25 03:42:57','2012-03-25 03:42:57','tom',0),(47,'Plain oil vegetable','Another kind of popular vegetable that is easy to cook and very healthy.',1,'2012-03-25 20:17:03','2012-03-25 20:17:03','tom',7),(48,'Chicken soup with red dates','The taste of chicken soup is great. The soup is easy to be digested by our bodies. The red dates have a lot of iron for helping the body grow. The red dates also help to sleep tight at night too.',1,'2012-03-25 21:19:17','2012-03-25 21:19:17','tom',1),(49,'Broccoli with beef','It is broccoli, and it is beef, they are my favorite ingredients. How can I don\'t like this dish.',1,'2012-03-25 22:35:20','2012-03-25 22:35:20','tom',7),(50,'Fry snap peas with pork','It is crunchy. Since it is fresh peas, it has the mixed taste of vegetable and beans.',1,'2012-05-02 22:38:42','2012-05-02 22:38:42','tom',7),(51,'Sweet and Sour Pumpkin','Pumpkin is kind of like melon fruit. It does not taste very sweet with a lot of juice like watermelon. This dish has the taste of melon, and also like some kind of vegetable. Since the preserved black beans are added to the dish, it has the sour taste too.',1,'2012-05-17 19:15:24','2012-05-17 19:15:24','tom',7),(52,'Messy potatos with chicken','It is kind of messy, but it really taste good, especially if you like chicken. After the juice come out the chicken, it mixing up with the potatoes. Since the potatoes are cooked for a while, it become a little bit of soft and messy, but it observe the juice from the chicken.',1,'2012-05-17 22:06:05','2012-05-17 22:06:05','tom',7),(53,'Beef with green peper','Beef with pepper is great dish, since the pepper and beef is easy to cook, it is great match for cooking. Moreover, since the green pepper is hard to observe the juice from beef, you still have taste of beef but with the smell the pepper. ',1,'2012-05-18 02:51:24','2012-05-18 02:51:24','tom',5),(55,'Fry pork chop with onion','The onion really taste good after it observe the juice for meat. After the onion had been cooked, it does not have the raw taste anymore. The pork is tasty with the smell the onion.',1,'2012-05-18 03:16:22','2012-05-18 03:16:22','tom',5),(56,'Chicken Nugget','The best of this dish is the skin of the nuggets. It tastes like  a potato chips, but with the juice from the fresh chicken.',1,'2012-05-19 19:08:34','2012-05-19 19:08:34','jessica',5),(57,'Steam Chicken with Mushrooms','The dried mushroom and lily flower are tasted so good on dish. Since they observe the juice from the chicken, they are really juice. The soup also is amazing too. if you mix the soup with the rice ever better.',1,'2012-05-19 19:35:42','2012-05-19 19:35:42','jessica',5),(58,'Steam Fish','Since the fishes is streamed, the freshness of meat from the fishes still be kept. However, we don\'t want the strong smell of the fishes, the green onions and the ginger take the smell away.  The fish soy sauce make it taste ever better.',1,'2012-06-13 01:20:18','2012-06-13 01:20:18','thomas',2),(59,'Steam pork ribs','The meat from the rids is easy to chew off from dish. The juice on this disk also taste very good. My daughter always ask me to put the sauce from the dish on her rices.',1,'2012-06-14 20:51:01','2012-06-14 20:51:01','tom',5),(60,'Fry green beans with ham','This dish is really my young daughter\'s favorite\'s favorite. Mixing all her favorite ingridients in one dish. It is really yummy for the dummy.',1,'2012-06-14 21:26:28','2012-06-14 21:26:28','tom',0),(61,'Steam fish salmon','Salmon along is prefect good already. It has been used for sushi all the time. After the salmon is steamed, the meat is smooth. Eating the smooth soft meat with your favorite sauce is even better.',1,'2012-06-15 00:45:08','2012-06-15 00:45:08','jessica',2);
