mpts</li>\r\n<li>With 1-step address input allow you to keep your eyes on the road while navigating with convenient voice guidance.</li>\r\n<li>HD Traffic technology</li>\r\n<li>Provides updates every 2 minutes, so you can avoid possible traffic jams and delays.</li>\r\n<li>LIVE services\r\nInclude weather forecasts so you can stay 1 step ahead of inclement weather.</li>\r\n<li>Bluetooth technology\r\nLets you make hands-free calls (mobile phone with Bluetooth capability required, not included).</li>',321.75,'GPS','TomTom - GO LIVE 2535M GPS','It is brand new, so it has the manufacture warranty. We also offer refund warranty if you don\'t like the product in 30 days. ','Free shipping','2011-11-21 04:12:47','tom',10,6,1,4,0,5.00,292.50),(20,'097855068590','Logitech','<li>With full-size of 121 low-profile keys and integrated number pad for enhanced productivity</li>\r\n<li>Allow you to watch videos, listen to music or launch applications at the touch of single button./li>\r\n<li>Optical mouse with a scroll wheel for ease of navigation.</li>\r\n<li>With a range of up to 32.8\' away from your computer.</li>\r\n<li>Compatible with any pc</li>\r\n<li>You can do typing far away your screen on the sofa</li>\r\n',59.99,'Keyboard','Logitech - MK320 Wireless Desktop Keyboard and Optical Mouse','It is brand new, so it has the manufacture warranty. We also offer refund warranty if you don\'t like the product in 30 days. ','Free shipping','2012-02-09 17:24:29','tom',14,20,2,10,0,5.20,28.19),(21,'920-002950','Logitech','<li>Reliable long-range 2.4 GHz wireless connection with a single USB receiver for the keyboard and mouse \r\n</li>\r\n<li>Long battery life?get 24 months of keyboard power and 5 months of mouse power without changing batteries \r\n</li>\r\n<li>Eight hot keys give you one-touch access to the Internet, e-mail, music volume and more \r\n</li>\r\n<li>Sleek all-in-one setup includes a compact keyboard with full-size keys and smooth-tracking optical mouse </li>\r\n<li>W