video source with s-video and composite audio (left/right), to your TV, monitor or a/v receiver. Ordinary  s-video cables often use low quality materials with inferior shielding that can result in poor picture quality. But our s-video/RCA cables deliver all the detail, color and brightness you expect from your audio/video equipment. The s-video component is constructed from individually double-shielded 75 Ohm coaxial cable that delivers high quality video images. The dual coax design carries the Video (Y) signal separate from the Color (C) to provide higher resolution and better picture quality. The dual audio conductor is high-quality 26 AWG 90% spiral-wrapped with tinned copper to provide shielding against EMI and RFI interference, and reduce unwanted noise and distortion. Gold-plated terminals ensure long-lasting, corrosion-free connections. Fully molded connectors provide excellent strain relief to keep your cable intact while the PVC jacket provides added flexibility and durability. Connector 1: One S-Video Male and Two RCA MaleConnector 2: One S-Video Male and Two RCA Male',17.99,'Audio Video Cables','6ft Value Series + trade, S-Video, RCA Stereo Audio Cable','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,175,3.00,11.01),(2310,'757120023104','cable','Make the right choice to connect any video source with s-video and composite audio (left/right), to your TV, monitor or a/v receiver. Ordinary  s-video cables often use low quality materials with inferior shielding that can result in poor picture quality. But our s-video/RCA cables deliver all the detail, color and brightness you expect from your audio/video equipment. The s-video component is constructed from individually double-shielded 75 Ohm coaxial cable that delivers high quality video images. The dual coax design carries the Video (Y) signal separate from the Color (C) to provide higher resolution and better picture quality. The dual aud