nting on relay racks. This shelf has a weight capacity of 50 lbs, but when used with the included mounting bracket, weight capacity is increased to 75 lbs. 10-32 and 12-24 hardware is also included.',77.99,'Cat5E / Cat6 Ethernet Cable','APW 19in Solid Centerweight Equipment Shelf - Black','Lifetime','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',128,10,10,3,37,3.00,71.34),(7857,'757120078579','cable','Use this cable to connect scanners, zip drives, external storage devices and other SCSI-1/2 peripherals. It features the Micro-Density 50-pin connector found on Fast SCSI-2 host adapters, and the DB25 connector found on many peripherals. With this cable, you can connect one peripheral directly to another, or to a SCSI host adapter card.Designed with a foil and braided shield overwrapping a twisted-pair construction, this cable uses a high quality 132 Ohm impedance wire appropriate for the SCSI-2 bus speeds.Cable shielding provides data integrity and maximum immunity to EMI/RFI interference. The shielding is meticulously handled by 360anddeg; soldering from the wire shielding to the metal shell which shields the connector.The squeeze latches which fasten the cable to the device are located for easy plug-in and removal, and ensure an on-going, dependable connection. Molded connectors provide strain relief and add additional protection against EMI/RFI interference. Connector 1: Micro-Density 50 MaleConnector 2: DB25 Male',35.99,'PC Cables','6ft SCSI-2 MD50M to SCSI-1 DB25M Cable','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,51,3.00,22.50),(7858,'757120078586','cable','Ultra2/Ultra3 SCSI provides the most competitive performance choice for high-traffic workstations, servers, multi-user systems, and storage area networks (SANs). This external cable meets these needs by increasing bus bandwidths which allows greater configuration flexibility, backward compatibility, and faster transfer rates. Manufactured with double-shielded wire with twisted-pair construction to minimize interference for error-free data transmission.Connector 1: Micro-Density 68 MaleConnector 2: Micro-Density 68 Male',42.99,'PC Cables','3ft SCSI-3 Ultra2 LVD/SE MD68 M/M Cable (Thumbscrew)','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,92,3.00,28.82),(7861,'757120078616','cable','Ultra SCSI (or SCSI-3), is the latest of the ever-improving SCSI standards, and is the cable of choice for such peripherals as the Iomega(R) zip drive. It includes specifications for a single-ended as well as a differential bus style. The single-ended is similar to Fast SCSI-2, except that it accommodates addressing up to 32 devices over a 16 bit single cable bus. This style also increases data throughput up to 20 Mbps in single-ended applications.Single-ended SCSI-3 is limited to 4 devices over 3 meters or 8 devices over 1.5 meters. Differential SCSI refers to a bus configuration using two wires per signal, with the signal being derived by the voltage difference between the two wires. This approach effectively eliminates noise on the SCSI bus and allows bus length to increase up to 25 meters.Connector 1: Micro-Density 68 MaleConnector 2: Centronics 50 Male',20.98,'PC Cables','6ft SCSI-3 MD68M (Thumbscrew) to SCSI-1 C50M Cable','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,83,3.00,8.88),(7862,'757120078623','cable','Ultra SCSI (or SCSI-3), is the latest of the ever-improving SCSI standards, and is the cable of choice for such peripherals as the Iomega(R) zip drive. It includes specifications for a single-ended as well as a differential bus style. The single-ended is similar to Fast SCSI-2, except that it accommodates addressing up to 32 devices over a 16 bit single cable bus. This style also increases data throughput up to 20 Mbps in single-ended applications.Single-ended SCSI-3 is limited to 4 devices over 3 meters or 8 devices over 1.5 meters. Differential SCSI refers to a bus configuration using two wires per signal, with the signal being derived by the voltage difference between the two wires. This approach effectively eliminates noise on the SCSI bus and allows bus length to increase up to 25 meters.Connector 1: Micro-Density 68 MaleConnector 2: Micro-Density 68 Male',34.99,'PC Cables','3ft SCSI-3 MD68 M/M Cable (Latch Clip)','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,146,3.00,24.75),(7882,'375712007882','cable','Easy to install on your cables to enable easy identification. Simply snap on the colored boots, and you have a quick, cheap solution to your cable run identification nightmare. Plus these boots also provide secondary strain relief for extra protection.',10.99,'Cat5E / Cat6 Ethernet Cable','RJ45 Patch Cord Boot - Black - 25pk','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,46,3.00,5.32),(7887,'375712007887','cable','Easy to install on your cables to enable easy identification. Simply snap on the colored boots, and you have a quick, cheap solution to your cable run identification nightmare. Plus these boots also provide secondary strain relief for extra protection.',10.99,'Cat5E / Cat6 Ethernet Cable','RJ45 Patch Cord Boot - Orange - 25pk','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,30,3.00,5.32),(7889,'375712007889','cable','Easy to install on your cables to enable easy identification. Simply snap on the colored boots, and you have a quick, cheap solution to your cable run identification nightmare. Plus these boots also provide secondary strain relief for extra protection.',10.99,'Cat5E / Cat6 Ethernet Cable','RJ45 Patch Cord Boot - Yellow - 25pk','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more t