m',0,10,10,3,60,3.00,15.60),(15833,'757120158332','cable','The SCA (Single Connector Attachment) interface combines the Data, Power, and SCSI ID connectors into a single 80-pin connector. To use this SCA drive in a standard system or subsystem enclosure, requires an adapter to convert the 80-pin connector back into separate Data, Power, and SCSI ID connectors. With this SCA adapter, you can make this conversion with ease as you adapt your 68-pin ribbon cable to a SCSI-3 SCA80-pin connection. The SCA80 adapter includes an onboard power connection and termination/id jumpers.Connector 1: SCSI-3 68-pin FemaleConnector 2: SCSI-3 HP(R) 80-pin Female',42.99,'Adapters or Connectors','Internal SCSI-3 68 Female to SCSI-3 SCA80 Female Adapter','1 year','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,44,3.00,27.38),(15970,'757120159704','cable','With SC to ST termination, this high-quality fiber optic patch cable is specifically designed for ethernet, multimedia, or communication applications. The SC connector features a push-pull locking system while the ST connector features a bayonet locking system.The patented injection molding process provides each connection greater durability in resisting pulls, strains and impacts from cabling installs.Each cable is 100% optically inspected and tested for insertion loss before you receive it. A pull-proof jacket design surrounds the popular 62.5/125 multimode fiber, immune to electrical interference.Connector 1: SC MaleConnector 2: ST Male',127.99,'Fiber Cables','30m SC/ST Duplex 62.5/125 Multimode Fiber Patch Cable - Orange','Lifetime','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,34,3.00,76.09),(16566,'757120165668','cable','For use with select Cybex KVM products, such as the Personal Commander, Autoview 200andtrade;, Duette Commanderandtrade;, and Autoview Commanderandtrade; lines. Equivalent to Cybex CUFC-6.',4.70,'KVM Cable, Switches','6ft Universal KVM Cable for Avocent(R) KVM','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,54,3.00,2.21),(16620,'757120166207','cable','Designed for the Cisco 7000 family, Cisco 4000 series, 3600 series, 2500 series, 1600 series, Cisco access servers, and AccessPro PC cards. This cable has a male DB-60 connector on the Cisco end and a male V.35 connector on the network end. With this item, you get the fit and functionality of the manufacturer\'s cable with greater convenience and a lower price. Guaranteed to comply with Cisco\'s rigid standards for original manufactured cabling specifications. DTE mode.Connector 1: DB60 MaleConnector 2: V.35 MalePlease Note: Cisco(R) is a registered trademark of Cisco Systems, Inc. AccessPro and Smart Serial may be trademarks of Cisco Systems, Inc. This product is not manufactured or endorsed by the Cisco Systems, Inc.',22.98,'Cat5E / Cat6 Ethernet Cable','10ft Cisco(R) Compatible DTE V.35 LFH60M-V.35M Cable','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,28,3.00,17.38),(16639,'757120166399','cable','The most common method of connecting an external peripheral (modem, digital camera, etc.) to a PC is via a serial port. Instead, many PC users want this connection but also want to save the ISA slot. The Lava DSerial-PCI does just that by adding two additional COM ports to any PCI-equipped PC. It improves your data throughput rate while saving valuable ISA slot real estate. With dual 9-pin serial ports with 16550 UART, it supports data throughput rates up to 115.2 Kbps on each port, saves an ISA slot, and fully supports PCI IRQ sharing.Because both ports share one PCI bus IRQ, even when accessed simultaneously, this card only requires one system IRQ and saves valuable resources for other expansion cards. With easy plug-and-play installation, it automatically selects the next available IRQ and COM address - just plug in and go!',62.99,'Cat5E / Cat6 Ethernet Cable','Lava + trade, Serial-PCI 2-Port PCI Dual 16550 DB9 Serial Card','Lifetime','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,56,3.00,56.18),(16751,'757120167518','cable','Gain maximum flexibility in positioning your VGA card and monitor with this premium shielded cable. This VGA cable is ideal for video splitters, KVM switches, video presentations, classroom environments, POS devices, server rooms, or just for organizing your work area for maximum comfort and efficiency. Constructed from premium grade video cable, it uses a combination of coax and twisted pair to accommodate cable runs up to 100 feet away without a booster (in most cases), and without the typical distortion problems associated with extended length cabling runs. This cable is designed to hold the signal over greater distances without boosting or reconditioning. SXGA provides a screen resolution of 1280 x 1024 pixels. Not sure what resolution you need? See our VGA resolution guide.Connector 1:HD15 MaleConnector 2:HD15 MalePlease Note: Pin 9 is not loaded. Pin 9 is not required for standard computer video applications.',24.99,'VGA','6ft Premium Shielded HD15 SXGA M/M Monitor Cable','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,1435,3.00,13.18),(16752,'757120167525','cable','Gain maximum flexibility in positioning your VGA card and monitor with this premium shielded cable. This VGA cable is ideal for video splitters, KVM switches, video presentations, classroom environments, POS devices, server rooms, or just for organizing your work area for maximum comfort and efficiency. Constructed from premium grade video cable, it uses a combination of coax and twisted pair to accommodate cable runs up to 100 feet away without a booster (in most cases), and without the typical distortion problems associated with extended length cabling runs. This cable is designed to hold the signal over greater distances without boosting or reconditioning. SXGA provides a screen resolution of 1280 x 1024 pixels. Not sure what resolution you need? See our VGA resolution guide.Connector 1:HD15 MaleConnector 2:HD15 MalePlease Note: Pin 9 is not loaded. Pin 9 is not required for standard computer video applications.',28.99,'VGA','10ft Premium Shielded HD15 SXGA M/M Monitor Cable','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,1209,3.00,17.32),(16816,'757120168164','cable','Cost-effective solution that provides high bandwidth and transmission rates over longer distances. With SC to SC termination, this high-quality fiber optic patch cable is specifically designed for gigabit ethernet applications. The patented injection molding process provides each connection greater durability in resisting pulls, strains and impacts from cabling installs.Each cable is 100% optically inspected and tested for insertion loss before you receive it. A pull-proof jacket design surrounds the popular 9/125 single mode fiber, immune to electrical interference.Connector 1: SC MaleConnector 2: SC Male',44.99,'Fiber Cables','5m SC/SC Duplex 9/125 Single Mode Fiber Patch Cable - Yellow','Lifetime','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,147,3.00,36.56),(16898,'757120168980','cable','Don\'t waste the parallel port on your inkjet, laser, or high speed printer. This cable uses the USB port on your PC or hub, so your parallel port remains free for a zip drive or scanner. Forget the hassles of IRQ sharing by adapting your printer to USB. If you have multiple printers, you can eliminate the need for a switchbox by connecting each printer to a USB port.The device is fully transparent to the user, and is ideal for true bi-directional communication. This adapter auto-negotiates hardware recognition for faster protocol setup, and is fully plug-and-play compatible. Connector 1: USB Type A MaleConnector 2: Centronics 36 Male',22.99,'Retail Items','6ft USB IEEE-1284 Parallel Printer Adapter Cable','1 year','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,3356,3.00,12.90),(16899,'757120168997','cable','Use this adapter cable to connect your inkjet, laser or high speed printer to a computer without a parallel port. Forget the hassles of IRQ sharing by adapting your printer to USB. If you have multiple printers, you can eliminate the need for a switchbox by connecting each printer to a USB port.The device is fully transparent to the user and is ideal for true bi-directional communication. This adapter auto-negotiates hardware recognition for faster protocol setup, and is fully plug-and-play compatible. Connector 1: USB Type A MaleConnector 2: DB25 Female',22.99,'USB','6ft USB to DB25 IEEE-1284 Parallel Printer Adapter Cable','1 year','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,9893,3.00,12.90),(16990,'757120169901','cable','IEEE-1394, also known as FireWire, iLink(R) or DV, is a versatile, high-speed, and low cost method of interconnecting a variety of computer peripherals and consumer electronics devices. FireWire provides a direct digital link among up to 63 devices, with transfer speeds up to 400 Mbps. Digital video (DV) camcorders, scanners, printers, videoconferencing cameras, and fixed disk drives can all share a common bus connection not only to a PC, but to each other as well.With Windows(R) ME(R) or Apple\'s FireWire Target Disk Mode you can use an IEEE-1394 cable to connect two computers together to allow for filesharing. Designed to be 100% compatible (1995 compliant) with Apple(R) FireWire, Sony(R) iLink, and all other IEEE-1394 peripherals. Twisted pair cabling and shielded construction ensure our FireWire meets or exceeds current IEEE-1394 standards.Hot-pluggable, our FireWire supports plug-and-play operation. Molded strain relief protects ensures years of trouble-free dat