u additonal RS-232 ports while it frees your RS-232 port for other uses.Input: One USB Type B FemaleOutput: Four DB9 Male',102.99,'Retail Items','USB to 4-Port DB9 Serial Adapter','1 year','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,304,3.00,85.81),(26630,'757120266303','cable','Ensures smooth implementation or easy expansion of a fast ethernet network. The converter is completely transparent, so the network performs exactly as it did before. Yet it now provides for the coexistence of both copper and fiber media, and allows the installation of fiber cabling anywhere within the network topology by connecting to existing devices. Its compact modular design facilitates space-saving deployment in a narrow desktop location. Comes with an external power supply.Input: SC FemaleOutput: RJ45 Female',142.99,'Cat5E / Cat6 Ethernet Cable','10/100Base-TX to MM 100Base-FX SC Media Converter','2 years','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,103,3.00,110.00),(26631,'757120266310','cable','Ensures smooth implementation or easy expansion of a fast ethernet network. The converter is completely transparent, so the network performs exactly as it did before. Yet it now provides for the coexistence of both copper and fiber media, and allows the installation of fiber cabling anywhere within the network topology by connecting to existing devices. Its compact modular design facilitates space-saving deployment in a narrow desktop location. Comes with an external power supply.Input: ST FemaleOutput: RJ45 Female',142.99,'Cat5E / Cat6 Ethernet Cable','10/100Base-TX to MM 100Base-FX ST Media Converter','2 years','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,180,3.00,110.00),(26686,'757120266860','cable','When you need just a little more distance, this cable will extend the reach of your USB A/B cable. Foil and braid shielding reduce EMI/RFI interference and twisted pair construction helps reduce crosstalk for a high-speed, error-free data transfer. USB 2.0 compatible. PC and Mac(R) compatible.Connector 1: USB Type A MaleConnector 2: USB Type A FemalePlease Note: Not for use beyond a total extended single length of 5 meters. For longer lengths or high-powered devices, please use #39978, 5m USB A Male to A Female Active Extension Cable.',16.99,'USB','3m USB 2.0 A Male to A Female Extension Cable - White','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,256,3.00,4.17),(26844,'757120268444','cable','A highly practical network installation and troubleshooting tool which features a single or multi-tone signal, two test leads and a 4-conductor modular cable. The tone generator\'s signal is easily traced by the probe, even when cables are in a bundle or hidden in a mess of punchdown blocks or wall plates. This system verifies cable continuity, identifies wiring faults, determines line polarity and voltage in network (Cat5 and coax) and modular telephone lines without damaging cable insulation.The probe includes a tone amplifier and an LED indicator that detects audible frequency tones for accurate tracing and identification of wires.Compact yet easy-to-use.Includes: a 2-position switch for single tone or multi-tone signals, a toggle switch to control 3 modes of operation, a 3-color LED indicator display for telephone line polarity, continuity and voltage testing, black and red testing leads and a standard 4-pin modular cable for individual wire tests or modular jack tests, a special inductive plastic tip which prevents accidental shorts (possible with copper-tip tracers) when using near high voltage devices, an adjustable volume level for various work environments, both an amplifier and LED for loud or dark work environments, and a power switch to prevent battery drain.',100.99,'Testers, Tools','Tone Generator and Probe','1 year','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,43,3.00,81.25),(26847,'757120268475','cable','Quickly read the status of ethernet twisted pair cables for faults such as open circuits, shorts, crossed pairs, reversed pairs and split pairs in seconds. The tester\'s compact design is very user-friendly, and enables the tester to be conveniently carried to any job site. This small hand-held tester includes one master unit and one remote unit easily operated by one person testing patch cords or installed cables. To prevent loss or damage, the small remote unit can easily slip into the master unit for easy storage. Includes: an easy-to-read fault display for high speed testing, a debug mode for detailed fault identification results, an auto sleep mode and power off switch to decrease power consumption, a built-in tone generator, and a low battery indicator. Plus this tester verifies shield integrity.',172.99,'Testers, Tools','LANtest Pro Remote Network Cable Tester with Tone and Probe','1 year','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,102,3.00,168.08),(26886,'757120268864','cable','Compatible with Windows(R) 7! Connecting USB with the traditional RS-232 serial port, this adapter connects cellphones, PDAs, digital cameras, modems, or ISDN terminal adapters through your USB port. Has a data transfer rate of over 230 kbps. Since the adapter uses no IRQs, there are no IRQ conflicts, and it is ideal for when you need many serial devices attached to your PC. Frees your RS-232 port for other uses. Connector 1: USB Type A MaleConnector 2: DB9 MaleClick here for the drivers for Windows 2000, XP, Vista, and Windows 7 32/64 bit. Click here for the drivers for Windows 98 or ME.',29.99,'Retail Items','1.5ft USB to DB9 Serial Adapter Cable','1 year','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,7152,3.00,18.64),(26887,'757120268871','cable','Connecting USB with the traditional RS-232 serial port, this adapter connects  cellphones, PDAs, digital cameras, modems, or ISDN terminal adapters through  your USB port. Has a data transfer rate of 