/40-pin IDC FemaleConnector 2: Two 80-wire/40-pin IDC FemalePlease Note: Your burst rates may vary due to cable length, type of drive and controller used.',3.24,'PC Cables','18in Economy Round 2-Device Ultra ATA133 EIDE Cable','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,1677,3.00,0.31),(26968,'757120269687','cable','For voice/data/video distribution, this cable will handle bandwidth-intensive applications up to 350 MHz. Meets all Cat5E TIA/EIA standards, and drastically reduces both impedance and structural return loss (SRL) when compared to standard 100 MHz wire.Each of the individual pairs is bonded together to help maintain the twist-spacing throughout the line right up to the termination point.Constructed from high-quality cable and a shortened body plug, this design minimizes Near-End Crosstalk (NEXT) levels.The molded, snagless boot prevents unwanted cable snags during installation and provides extra strain relief. Available in a variety of colors to easily color-code your network installation.Connector 1: RJ45 MaleConnector 2: RJ45 Male',9.49,'Cat5E / Cat6 Ethernet Cable','1ft Cat5E 350 MHz Snagless Patch Cable - Red','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,1727,3.00,2.35),(27005,'757120270058','cable','A handy replacement for a lost cable, or a nice spare for the office. Just plug-and-play for many digital camera models, cellphones, MP3 players, PDAs and other mini-USB devices. This cable provides a transfer rate up to 480 Mbps depending upon the peripheral\'s USB version, and is ideal for transferring pictures from your digital camera to your PC or Mac. Foil and braid shielding reduces EMI/RFI interference and twisted pair construction helps reduce crosstalk thus ensuring high-speed, error-free data transfer.Connector 1: USB Type A MaleConnector 2: USB Type Mini-b 5-pin Male',15.99,'USB','2m USB 2.0 A to Mini-b Cable','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,7821,3.00,3.60),(27015,'757120270157','cable','Connect your DVD or CD player, Mini Disc, DAT, game console or other digital audio equipment for clear, full and richly detailed sound. Optical cables transfer the signal by using light; thus completely eliminating any chance for RFI, EMI or ground loop interference. This cable is manufactured from high-quality optical fiber with a polished lens and gold-plated collar.The stylish, ultra-flexible PVC jacket enhances cable durability for years of listening pleasure. A 1mm low loss core conductor ensures low distortion to maintain an accurate digital signal. Protective plastic cover protects lens from dust, dirt and other debris while a non-slip rubber grip connector enables easy installation.Connector 1: TOSLINK MaleConnector 2: Mini Plug Male',19.99,'Audio Video Cables','1m Velocity + trade, TOSLINK(R)-to-Optical Mini Plug Digital Cable','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,228,3.00,11.04),(27027,'757120270270','cable','Split the digital audio signal from your CD or DVD player or other digital device, and connect to both your receiver and recorder.Input: Oneandnbsp;TOSLINK FemaleOutput: Two TOSLINK FemalePlease Note: This splitter is not designed to connect two sources (DVD player, cable box, game system) to one destination (TV, home theater receiver). Instead, it is only designed to take one source and split its signal to go to two destinations.',12.99,'Audio Video Cables','TOSLINK(R) Digital Audio Splitter','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,938,3.00,6.33),(27028,'757120270287','cable','100% compatible with Apple(R) FireWire, Sony(R) iLink(R), and all other IEEE-1394a peripherals. This adapter converts a 6-pin male cable to a 4-pin conn