rs of trouble-free data transmissions. Compatible with PC, Mac(R), Sun(R) and other IEEE-1394 equipped computers.Connector 1: 4-pin 1394a MaleConnector 2: 4-pin 1394a MalePlease Note: Use the 4-pin cable for non-powered devices, and the 6-pin cable to provide power to devices. FireWire(R) and the FireWire symbol are trademarks of Apple(R) Computer, Inc., registered in the U.S. and other countries. The FireWire logo is a trademark of Apple Computer, Inc. This product is not manufactured or endorsed by Apple Computer, Inc.',18.99,'FireWire','1m IEEE-1394a FireWire(R) 4-pin to 4-pin Cable (3.2ft)','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,158,3.00,9.28),(27292,'757120272922','cable','Whether installing your first home theater or just adding additional speakers, our speaker wire will deliver quality audio every time. Featuring easy-to-connect 99.9% pure copper conductors, this flexible speaker wire is easy to handle and install. A clear flexible PVC jacket surrounds two parallel conductors, one bare copper and one tinned copper conductor for easy identification of polarity.Please Note: Banana plugs are not included with this bulk wire; this is not an interconnect.',19.99,'Bulk Cable','50ft 16 AWG Bulk Speaker Wire','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,61,3.00,14.78),(27293,'757120272939','cable','Whether installing your first home theater or just adding additional speakers, our speaker wire will deliver quality audio every time. Featuring easy-to-connect 99.9% pure copper conductors, this flexible speaker wire is easy to handle and install. A clear flexible PVC jacket surrounds two parallel conductors, one bare copper and one tinned copper conductor for easy identification of polarity.Please Note: Banana plugs are not included with this bulk wire; this is not an interconnect.',35.99,'Bulk Cable','100ft 16 AWG Bulk Sp