an $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,399,3.00,21.42),(27801,'757120278016','cable','For voice/data/video distribution, this cable will handle bandwidth-intensive applications up to 550 MHz. Meets all Cat6 TIA/EIA-568-B-2.1, draft 9 standards, and drastically reduces both impedance and structural return loss (SRL) when compared to standard 100 MHz wire.Each of the individual pairs is bonded together to help maintain the twist-spacing throughout the line right up to the termination point.Constructed from high-quality cable and a shortened body plug, this design minimizes Near-End Crosstalk (NEXT) levels.The molded, snagless boot prevents unwanted cable snags during installation and provides extra strain relief. Available in a variety of colors to easily color-code your network installation.Connector 1: RJ45 MaleConnector 2: RJ45 Male',11.99,'Cat5E / Cat6 Ethernet Cable','3ft Cat6 550 MHz Snagless Patch Cable - Purple','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,1378,3.00,3.69),(27821,'757120278214','cable','Fast, fast, fast - for data/voice/video distribution! This 550 MHz-rated patch cable ensures you always have the necessary throughput to handle today\'s and tomorrow\'s bandwidth-intensive applications. The crossed pin configuration allows you to connect two computers peer-to-peer without the need for a hub or switch. You can also use the crossover cable to connect network switches and hubs without an uplink port to other switches and hubs.Each cable is fully tested and quality inspected, and meets all EIA/TIA Cat 6 TIA/EIA- 568-B-2.1, draft 9 standards. When compared to standard 100 MHz wire, it drastically reduces both impedance and structural return loss (SRL) which ensures error-free transmission. Constructed from high-quality cable and a shortened body plug, this design minimizes Near-End Crosstalk (NEXT) levels.Our all-new molded, snagless clip prevents unwanted cable snags during installation without impairing your ability to insert and remove the connector from the port. It also provides unparalleled strain relief so that the cable is not damaged even when pulled excessively. Available in a variety of colors to easily color-code your network installation.Connector 1: RJ45 MaleConnector 2: RJ45 MalePlease Note: This cable is for 10/100 ethernet only and will not work for gigabit ethernet since only two pairs of this cable are crossed.',13.99,'Cat5E / Cat6 Ethernet Cable','3ft Cat6 550 MHz Snagless Crossover Cable - Gray','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,661,3.00,4.51),(27861,'757120278610','cable','Fast, fast, fast - for data/voice/video distribution! This 550 MHz-rated patch cable ensures you always have the necessary throughput to handle today\'s and tomorrow\'s bandwidth-intensive applications. The crossed pin configuration allows you to connect two computers peer-to-peer without the need for a hub or switch. You can also use the crossover cable to connect network switches and hubs without an uplink port to other switches and hubs.Each cable is fully tested and quality inspected, and meets all EIA/TIA Cat 6 TIA/EIA- 568-B-2.1, draft 9 standards. When compared to standard 100 MHz wire, it drastically reduces both impedance and structural return loss (SRL) which ensures error-free transmission. Constructed from high-quality cable and a shortened body plug, this design minimizes Near-End Crosstalk (NEXT) levels.Our all-new molded, snagless clip prevents unwanted cable snags during installation without impairing your ability to insert and remove the connector from the port. It also provides unparalleled strain relief so that the cable is not damaged even when pulled excessively. Available in a variety of colors to easily color-code your network installation.Connector 1: RJ45 MaleConnector 2: RJ45 MalePlease Note: This cable is for 10/100 ethernet only and w