n this manner may cause irreparable damage to your computers.andnbsp; We do offer a USB file transfer cable (#39997) to connect two computers together.',12.99,'USB','2m USB 2.0 A Male to A Male Cable - Black (6.5ft)','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,560,3.00,3.21),(28107,'757120281078','cable','When a standard USB cable cannot transfer enough power to operate an external device, such as a portable 2.5in hard drive, you need a USB 2.0 y-cable. Simply plug this cable\'s USB Mini-b end into the device, and then plug the two USB A ends into open USB ports on one PC or Mac. This cable then pulls power from both USB ports, and thus increases the output to the external drive. The red molded hood on the auxiliary USB A connector enables the user to quickly distinguish between main and auxiliary power. Foil and braid shielding reduces EMI/RFI interference, and twisted pair construction reduces crosstalk for high speed, error-free data transfer. This cable is compatible with USB 1.0, 1.1, and 2.0 specifications.Connector 1: One USB Mini-b Male (5 pin)Connector 2: Two USB Type A MalePlease Note: This cable is not designed to split USB signals to multiple computers. The two USB A connectors are meant to plug into USB ports on the same computer. Furthermore, thanks to customer feedback, we have extended the length of the arms of the Y from 9 to 12 inches.',15.99,'USB','6ft USB 2.0 One Mini-b Male to Two A Male Y-Cable','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,1862,3.00,5.32),(28108,'757120281085','cable','When a standard USB cable cannot transfer enough power to operate an external device, such as a portable 2.5in hard drive, you need a USB 2.0 y-cable. Simply plug this cable\'s USB B end into the device, and then plug the two USB A ends into open USB ports on one PC or Mac. This cable then pulls power from both USB ports, and thus increases the output to the external drive.The red molded hood on the auxiliary USB A connector enables the user to quickly distinguish between main and auxiliary power. Foil and braid shielding reduces EMI/RFI interference, and twisted pair construction reduces crosstalk for high speed, error-free data transfer. This cable is compatible with USB 1.0, 1.1, and 2.0 specifications.Connector 1: One USB Type B MaleConnector 2: Two USB Type A MalePlease Note: This cable is not designed to split USB signals to multiple computers. The two USB A connectors are meant to plug into USB ports on the same computer.',13.99,'USB','6ft USB 2.0 One B Male to Two A Male Y-Cable','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,614,3.00,4.99),(28109,'757120281092','cable','Just plug-and-play for keyboards, mice, modems, printers, and other USB peripherals. This cable provides a transfer rate up to 480 Mbps depending upon the peripheral\'s USB version, and easily attaches to any USB device. Foil and braid shielding reduces EMI/RFI interference and twisted pair construction helps reduce crosstalk thus ensuring high-speed, error-free data transfer. Its small right angle form factor is ideal for today\'s compact portable devices while easily transferring data or charging your devices.Connector 1: USB Right Angle Type A MaleConnector 2: USB Right Angle Type B Male',10.99,'USB','1m USB 2.0 Right Angle A/B Cable - Black (3.2ft)','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,284,3.00,4.89),(28112,'757120281122','cable','Just plug-and-play for keyboards, mice, modems, printers, and other USB peripherals. This cable provides a transfer rate up to 480 Mbps depending upon the peripheral\'s USB version, and easily attaches to any USB device. Foil and braid shielding reduces EMI/RFI interference and twisted pair construction helps reduce crosstalk thus ensuring high-speed, error-free data transfer. Its small right angle form factor is ideal for today\'s compact portable devices while easily transferring data or charging your devices.Connector 1: USB Right Angle Type A MaleConnector 2: USB Right Angle Type B Male',20.99,'USB','5m USB 2.0 Right Angle A/B Cable - Black (16.4ft)','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,610,3.00,9.50),(28113,'757120281139','cable','Connect to cell phones, GPS systems, PDAs, OTG devices and digital cameras by using the micro-USB connection on your computer or other USB device. The micro-USB connector is smaller and thinner than the previous USB Mini-b standard while offering better performance. Its small right angle form factor is ideal for today\'s compact portable devices while easily transferring data or charging your device at a transfer speed up to 480 Mbps. This cable is compliant with USB 2.0 specifications and the On-The-Go supplement.Connector 1: USB Right Angle Type A MaleConnector 2: USB Right Angle Type Micro B Male',13.99,'USB','1m USB 2.0 A Right Angle Male to Micro-USB B Right Angle Male Cable (3.2ft)','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,170,3.00,5.84),(28200,'757120282006','cable','Free up space between components by extending your mouse or keyboard cable. Each PS/2 cable is constructed from top quality foil-shielded wire to prevent EMI/RFI interference, and is fully molded to ensure excellent strain relief and a clean, professional appearance.Connector 1: 6-pin Mini Din MaleConnector 2: 6-pin Mini Din Female',42.99,'PC Cables','35ft PS2 M/F Keyboard/Mouse Extension Cable','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,1805,3.00,27.37),(28201,'757120282013','cable','Free up space between components by extending your mouse or keyboard cable. Each PS/2 cable is constructed from top quality foil-shielded wire to prevent EMI/RFI interference, and is fully molded to ensure excellent strain relief and a clean, professional appearance.Connector 1: 6-pin Mini Din MaleConnector 2: 6-pin Mini Din Female',46.99,'PC Cables','50ft PS/2 M/F Keyboard/Mouse Extension Cable','Lifetime','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,158,3.00,31.58),(28202,'757120282020','cable','Free up space between components by extending your mouse or keyboard cable. Each PS/2 cable is constructed from top quality foil-shielded wire to prevent EMI/RFI interference, and is fully molded to ensure excellent strain relief and a clean, professional appearance.Connector 1: 6-pin Mini Din MaleConnector 2: 6-pin Mini Din Female',62.99,'PC Cables','75ft PS2 M/F Keyboard/Mouse Extension Cable','Lifetime','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',48,10,10,3,60,3.00,37.74),(28203,'757120282037','cable','Free up space between components by extending your mouse or keyboard cable. Each PS/2 cable is constructed from top quality foil-shielded wire to prevent EMI/RFI interference, and is fully molded to ensure excellent strain relief and a clean, professional appearance.Connector 1: 6-pin Mini Din MaleConnector 2: 6-pin Mini Din Female',72.99,'PC Cables','100ft PS/2 M/F Keyboard/Mouse Extension Cable','Lifetime','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',48,10,10,3,90,3.00,50.61),(28224,'757120282242','cable','An easy and fast way to connect USB devices to your PC or Macintosh(R) computer. Seven high speed ports connect you to an almost limitless number of USB devices including modems, scanners, printers, PC cameras, digital cameras, keyboards, telephones, and other high-tech appliances. The hub\'s design is specifically as a space-saving function and multi-connection convenience.Connect to the hub for easy download and editing of your digital pictures, MP3s and video streams. Our hub supports self-power mode, and has built-in overcurrent protection. Each port handles up to 480 Mbps, and is fully plug-and-play, hot-swappable, and daisy-chainable up to 127 devices. Supported under Windows(R) and Mac(R), our 7-port hub enables your laptop or desktop computer to multi-task with all your high-speed USB 2.0 devices. This kit includes five colored USB 2.0 cables so you can stop wondering which cable is connected to which device. Color-code all your devices and ports!Input: One 5V/3A Power Male and Seven USB Type A FemaleOutput: One USB Type B FemaleCable Connector 1: One USB Type A MaleCable Connector 2: One USB Type B Male',82.99,'USB','7-Port USB 2.0 Hub with (5) Colored USB 2.0 Cables','1 year for device, lifetime for cables','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',48,10,10,3,26,3.00,72.34),(28230,'757120282303','cable','On the airplane when the lights are shut off, in the dimly lit conference room, or in bed when you don\'t want to wake up your partner - our laptop light is handy to provide just enough light to get the job done but still be considerate. Ideal for travelers and students alike, this featherweight light illuminates your keyboard without distracting others around you.It plugs directly into an available USB port so no external power supply is needed. The flexible neck bends easily so you can arrange the light in any position you like, yet it is rigid enough to hold its shape. The LED light reliably provides light for up to 8,000 hours, so you\'ll never be caught in the dark again!Connector: One USB Type A Male',14.99,'USB','16in USB Laptop Light Cable','1 year','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,632,3.00,8.72),(28243,'757120282433','cable','The Flexima UXGA cable delivers high performance AND flexibility. This ultra-thin cable is highly flexible to make installation in even the tightest areas a breeze. Unlike cheap VGA cables, the Flexima cable will not coil or snag during installation. And, the low profile connector helps you install this cable in places other connectors won\'t allow. Quality is also proven in the performance of these cables. Featuring ferrites to protect against EMI/RFI interference, double-shielded twisted pairs, and triple-shielded coax, this monitor cable delivers the signal without ghosting or distortion. Use it for video presentations, home theater and HDTV applications, classroom environments, POS devices, and server rooms. Or simply organize your work area for maximum comfort and efficiency. Will accommodate cable runs up to 100 feet without a booster (in most cases). CL3-rated for in-wall installation.Please Note:UXGA provides a screen resolution of 1600 x 1200 pixels. Not sure what resolution you need? See our VGA resolution guide.Connector 1:HD15 MaleConnector 2:HD15 MalePlease Note:All 15 pins in this cable assembly are loaded.',45.99,'VGA','6ft Flexima + trade, HD15 UXGA M/M Monitor Cable','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,1442,3.00,25.92),(28250,'757120282501','cable','The Flexima UXGA + 3.5mm cable delivers high performance AND flexibility. This ultra-thin cable is highly flexible to make installation in even the tightest areas a breeze. Unlike cheap VGA cables, the Flexima cable will not coil or snag during installation. And, the low profile connector (1.25in width x 1.1in depth) helps you install this cable in places other connectors won\'t allow. Quality is also proven in the performance of these cables. Featuring double-shielded twisted pairs, and triple-shielded coax, this monitor cable delivers the signal without ghosting or distortion. The 3.5mm breakout cable (18in long) enables installationandnbsp;with most laptop and desktop configurations.Use it for video presentations, home theater and HDTV applications, classroom environments, POS devices, and server rooms. Or simply organize your work area for maximum comfort and efficiency. Will accommodate cable runs up to 100 feet without a booster (in most cases). CL3-rated for in-wall installation.UXGA provides a screen resolution of 1600 x 1200 pixels. Not sure what resolution you need? See our VGA resolution guide.Connector 1:One HD15 Male and One 3.5mm Stereo MaleConnector 2:One HD15 Male and One 3.5mm Stereo MalePlease Note:All 15 pins in this cable assembly are loaded.',52.99,'VGA','6ft Flexima + trade, HD15 UXGA, 3.5mm Stereo Audio M/M Monitor Cable','Lifetime','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,173,3.00,34.42),(28279,'757120282792','cable','Updated version of item #28278, 13W3 Male to HD15 VGA Female Pinning Adapter. Has revised signals and a resistor and therefore is compatible with the newer Sun(R) systems. This adapter connects Sun workstations to monitors, and Sun workstations to the new Sun monitors that have an HD15 VGA connector. Do not use with SGIs. Functionally equivalent to Sunandreg #130-3034.Connector 1: 13W3 MaleConnector 2: HD15 Female',32.99,'VGA','13W3 Male to HD15 Female Entry Level to Turbo GX Adapter (SUN# 130-3034)','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,55,3.00,23.80),(28291,'757120282914','cable','This Ultra2/Ultra3 LVD/SE external VHDCI (Very High-Density Cable Interconnect) cable features 28 AWG double-shielded twisted-pair cabling, ferrites and 0.8mm 68-pin molded connectors to reduce EMI/RFI interference. Designed to meet or exceed SCSI specifications, this cable is primarily used to connect advanced SCSI multiport applications to RAID controllers, and is built with the offset connector so that it may be used in stacking environments.The small footprint allows up to four channels to be connected on a single card, and offers excellent shielding against data loss. Twisted pair conductors ensure that each data line is paired with a ground line to minimize interference. Foil and braid shielding with 360anddeg; soldering plus ferrite cores with direct shield contact reduce EMI/RFI interference for error-free data transfer.Connector 1: 0.8mm 68-pin MaleConnector 2: 0.8mm 68-pin MalePlease Note: VHDCI cables are also referred to as SCSI-V cables.',66.98,'PC Cables','3ft LVD/SE VHDCI.8mm 68-pin M/M Cable with Ferrites','Lifetime','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,190,3.00,33.06),(28294,'757120282945','cable','This Ultra2/Ultra3 LVD/SE external VHDCI (Very High-Density Cable Interconnect) cable features 28 AWG double-shielded twisted-pair cabling, ferrites and 0.8mm 68-pin molded connectors to reduce EMI/RFI interference. Designed to meet or exceed SCSI specifications, this cable is primarily used to connect advanced SCSI multiport applications to RAID controllers.The small footprint allows up to four channels to be connected on a single card. Twisted pair conductors ensure that each data line is paired with a ground line to minimize interference, while braid and foil shielding reduces EMI/RFI interference for error-free data transfer. Provides for a longer possible cabling distance (up to 25 meters) by using Low Voltage Differential (LVD) signaling.Connector 1: 0.8mm 68-pin MaleConnector 2: Micro-Density 68 MalePlease Note: VHDCI cables are also referred to as SCSI-V cables.',11.75,'PC Cables','3ft LVD/SE VHDCI.8mm 68-pin Male to SCSI-3 MD68 Male Cable with Ferrites','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,34,3.00,11.38),(28428,'757120284284','cable','Our Cat5E network kit has everything you need for a successful installation: 500 feet of gray Cat5E UTP stranded PVC patch cable, RJ45 crimping tool, 50 modular plugs with RJ45 connectors, and the Multi-Network Cable Tester-E. This tester is specifically designed for quick testing of your network cables, and features high-speed auto scanning for wire continuity, miswiring and polarization.Test installed cables with its compact remote terminator that conveniently slides into the master unit to prevent misplacement. These modular plugs are designed to terminate either stranded or solid conductor wire and to accommodate either oval or round cable. They also are manufactured with 50-micron gold-plated contacts for reliable data transfers.',162.99,'Cat5E / Cat6 Ethernet Cable','500ft Cat5E UTP 100 MHz Stranded PVC CM-Rated Cable Installation Kit - Gray','Lifetime','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',192,10,10,3,53,3.00,149.90),(28593,'757120285939','cable','Replace your overused or misplaced power cable, or just get some extra cords for convenience. This universal right-angled power cord is ideal for tight areas and will plug into PCs, monitors, scanners, printers and other devices that use the 3-pin shroud power connector. Plus this heavy-duty 18 AWG cord features a fully molded design for maximum durability and long life.The female connector plugs directly into the device while the male connector plugs into a standard outlet.Connector 1: 3-pin shroud Female (IEC320C13R)Connector 2: 3-prong grounded plug Male (NEMA 5-15P)',17.99,'Power cords and Surge','14ft 18 AWG Universal Right Angle Power Cord (NEMA 5-15P to IEC320C13R)','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,450,3.00,8.05),(28652,'757120286523','cable','This is the solution for laptop users who also like to use their laptop in the office, but don\'t like the hassle of connecting each device every time. With this station, connect all peripherals to the docking station, then use the included cable to connect the laptop to the dock. All your peripherals are now connected, with just one cable! This lets you come and go as you please without the hassle of repeatedly connecting and reconnecting devices to your laptop.This station contains a 3-port USB 2.0 hub, one serial DB9 port, one parallel printer port, one 10/100 RJ45 ethernet port, PS/2 mouse and keyboard ports, and a VGA pass-through port - all in just one unit! Connect your monitor, mouse, keyboard, printer, network, modem, and any USB 2.0 devices to the docking station for a convenient all-in-one connectivity solution.This docking station eliminates the clutter of cables connecting to your computer as it requires only a single VGA/USB combo cable. Additional USB hubs can be attached to allow you to daisy-chain up to 127 devices. Plug-and-play functionality eliminates the need to reboot during installation. This simple station makes desktop use of your laptop amazingly simple, convenient and, most importantly, inexpensive.  This dock is designed as a andldquo;universalandrdquo; docking station. Due to the differing power requirements of different makes and models of laptop, providing power to the laptop is not a feature of our docking station. Our dock is designed to add an Ethernet port, a 9-pin Serial port, a 25-pin Parallel printer port, 2 PS/2 ports, a 3 port USB hub, and a VGA monitor pass through.Input: One DB9 RS-232 Serial Female, One DB25 Parallel Male (for IEEE-1284 bidirectional printers), Two PS/2 Female (for keyboard and mouse), One RJ45 Female, and One HD15 Male Output: Three USB Type A Female and One HD15 FemaleDownload the product drivers now. Note: This file is over 40 MB and thus may take some time to download.',72.99,'USB','USB 2.0 Laptop Docking Station with Video','1 year','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',32,10,10,3,278,3.00,71.09),(28653,'757120286530','cable','Come and go as you please without the hassle of repeatedly connecting and reconnecting devices to your computer. The Trulink Desktop Docking Station adds convenience and flexibility to any office environment andndash; whether at home or at work. With universal connectivity capability, it acts as a central hub for nearly any model of laptop, netbook or desktop using peripherals. This makes it a valuable addition particularly in settings when disparate brands of equipment are used or computer equipment is swapped out frequently.A single USB connection controls the analog/digital video, four additional USB ports, Ethernet connection and audio input/output. After installing the included drivers, usage is plug-and-play with no computer reset or added docking/undocking procedures required. Because it uses USB 2.0 speeds, performance is smooth and reliable with no lag in audio/video even when multiple peripherals are connected. Video resolutions up to 1900x1200 are supported through the DVI-I connection which easily converts to VGA using the included adapter.Output: One One USB Type B FemaleInput: One DVI-I Female, One 3.5mm Audio Input, One 3.5mm Audio Output, Four USB 2.0 Ports, One Ethernet Port (10/100 Base-T) Download Driver: Link',132.99,'USB','Trulink(R) USB Universal Docking Station','1 Year','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',32,10,10,3,678,3.00,117.35),(28690,'757120286905','cable','Protect your high speed network from noise and electromagnetic interference when you connect with our shielded Cat5E patch cable. Meets or exceeds industry standards for NEXT and return loss. The molded boot provides extra strain relief and durability. Available in a variety of colors to easily color-code your network installation.Connector 1: RJ45 MaleConnector 2: RJ45 MalePlease Note: For maximum protection against EMI/RFI interference, use our Cat5E shielded patch panel (#03864) and Cat5E shielded keystone jacks for complete end-to-end protection.',13.99,'Cat5E / Cat6 Ethernet Cable','3ft Shielded Cat5E Molded Patch Cable - Black','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,682,3.00,5.75),(28724,'757120287247','cable','Enables data transmission up to 10 times faster than an ordinary phone cable when connecting telephones, answering machines, and fax machines. Ultra-flexible jacket makes cable installation easy. 24k gold-plated connectors provide corrosion resistance for maximum conductivity. Snagless, molded connector enables increased flexibility and durability for effective strain relief.Foil double-shielding with the braid shield reduce interference while the twisted-pair construction minimizes crosstalk for high-speed, error-free data transfer. Connector 1: RJ11 (6P4C) MaleConnector 2: RJ11 (6P4C) Male',36.99,'Cat5E / Cat6 Ethernet Cable','50ft RJ11 High-Speed Internet Modem Cable','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,54,3.00,25.79),(28731,'757120287315','cable','Why connect and reconnect cables to manually switch between devices? Get rid of the cable hassle, and add flexibility to your home theater system with the 3-Play selector. Plug in this switch and quickly add three TOSLINK, three s-video, and three RCA composite audio/video ports to your system. Great for connecting three of the following: DVD players, satellite receivers, video game consoles or digital video recorders - any devices that have dual channel analog or TOSLINK audio with s-video or composite video.This is an ideal solution for the a/v enthusiast who wants to take full control of an ever-expanding system. Use the wireless remote control or the three front panel input selector buttons to quickly change sources. Input: Three S-Video Female, Three TOSLINK Female, Three RCA Audio/Video FemaleOutput: One S-Video Female, One TOSLINK Female, One RCA Audio/Video FemalePlease Note: This unit does not convert s-video to composite video, or composite video to s-video; the output signal is always the same as the original input signal. For your convenience, the following replacement parts are available for this item: Item #98009 - AC/DC Adapter, and Item #98014 - IR Wireless Remote Control. To order a replacement part, please call us.',55.99,'Retail Items','3-Play + trade, S-Video, Composite Video, TOSLINK(R) Digital Audio High Performance Selector Switch','1 year','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',48,10,10,3,995,3.00,49.36),(28733,'757120287339','cable','Most newer audio equipment (such as TVs, cable boxes, CD players and gaming consoles) only outputs audio signals through digital optical or digital coaxial connections. That limitation can prevent you from outputtingandnbsp;sound toandnbsp;your stereo equipment which may only accept analog signals.andnbsp;Our DAC s the ideal solution to convert digital audio signals to analog audio. Once in analog format, the signal can then be distributed up to 150 feet away, surpassing the length limitations of digital audio. This not only provides added flexibility for equipment placement, but also saves money by eliminating the need to purchase digital repeaters. This plug-and-play solution requires no additional software or drivers and supports Windows(R) 7. Up to three different devices can be connected at the same time using S/PDIF coaxial, TOSLINK optical, or USB input. This not only accommodates a variety of equipment types but also allows for multiple configurations based on the userandrsquo;s custom setup.Connector 1: One USB B Female, One TOSLINK Female, andandnbsp;One RCA Female (S/PDIF)Connector 2: Two RCA Female and One 3.5mm FemalePlease Note: This device cannot convert compressed digital audio formats such as Dolby Digital(R) or DTS(R). It can only convert non-compressed audioandnbsp;such asandnbsp;PCM to an analog output.',82.99,'PC to TV','Digital to Analog Audio Converter (DAC)','1 year','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,752,3.00,72.36),(28734,'757120287346','cable','Expand your flexibility by adding up to three sources to your home theater system\'s optical digital audio input. This selector features high integrity toslink jacks to optimally transfer light signals, and to prevent the wear and tear on your toslink cables that comes from manually connecting and reconnecting cables. And, the compact size of this switch lets you place it almost anywhere. Great for DVD players, game consoles, audio CD recorders,