 There is no software required, or complicated interface cards to install. This powered monitor splitter not only distributes, but also boosts your high resolution video signal up to 210 feet.Includes power-saving mode, color-coded connectors for the input and outputs, durable all-metal housing, power and activity LED indicators. Also suitable for XGA, SVGA, VGA, and MultiSync(R) resolution monitors. Daisy-chain multiple units together for even more outputs.Input: One HD15 FemaleOutput: Two HD15 FemalePlease Note: The term extender refers to the product\'s ability to extend the distance of your cable runs to 210 feet. It does not mean the product provides extended desktop functionality, or the ability to view different information on each of your monitors. If you are looking to add extended desktop capabilities to your computer, please consider product #30534, 6in USB 2.0 to XGA Adapter. UXGA provides a screen resolution of 1600 x 1200 pixels. Not sure what resolution you need? See our VGA resolution guide.',62.99,'Retail Items','TruLink(R) 2-Port UXGA Monitor Splitter/Extender (Female Input)','1 year','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',32,10,10,3,4786,3.00,55.31),(29504,'757120295044','cable','Distribute any video signal toandnbsp;4 different video outputs, while maintaining vivid picture quality. Though powerful, this splitter is easy to use; just connect the cables, and you\'re ready to go! There is no software required, or complicated interface cards to install. This powered monitor splitter not only distributes, but also boosts your high resolution video signal up to 210 feet.Includes power-saving mode, color-coded connectors for the input and outputs, durable all-metal housing, power and activity LED indicators. Also suitable for XGA, SVGA, VGA, and MultiSync(R) resolution monitors. Daisy-chain multiple units together for even more outputs.Input: One HD15 FemaleOutput:andnbsp;Four HD15 FemalePlease Note: The term extender refers to the product\'s ability to extend the distance of your cable runs to 210 feet. It does not mean the product provides extended desktop functionality, or the ability to view different information on each of your monitors. If you are looking to add extended desktop capabilities to your computer, please consider product #30534, 6in USB 2.0 to XGA Adapter. UXGA provides a screen resolution of 1600 x 1200 pixels. Not sure what resolution you need? See our VGA resolution guide.',87.99,'Retail Items','TruLink(R) 4-Port UXGA Monitor Splitter/Extender (Female Input)','1 year','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',32,10,10,3,124,3.00,68.59),(29506,'757120295068','cable','The TruLink Wireless Digital Signage Distribution System (WDSDS) enables video with stereo audio to be distributed and synchronized wirelessly across multiple displays. The 802.11a/g wireless capabilities allow easy installation of digital signs in locations where running cables is difficult. For added flexibility, the WDSDS can be used in wired mode that utilizes standard Cat5/6 cables - ideal for situations where you need to place the monitors long distances from the media player. The WDSDS supports up to 32 screens wirelessly or can be used in wired mode to support up to 1,000 screens. The high degree of flexibility and ease of setup allow digital signage displays to be placed virtually anywhere.The WDSDS can be used in wireless modes in two ways. It can be used as its own private network for simple plug-and-play setup, or it can be placed on an existing network as its own isolated segment. Because the WDSDS is ethernet-based, users can use their existing network infrastructure* and inexpensive off-the-shelf networking hardware. The Transmitter distributes data only to the network where Receivers are connected via the network interface select feature; this avoids distribution to other networks in order to reduce network traffic. Plug-and-play functionality enables the transmitter and receivers to automatically detect one another, and that makes installation and setup quick and easy!Note: *This system uses standard ethernet network infrastructure allowing digital signs to be connected using network cabling and equipment that is already installed in a building. It is strongly recommended that WDSDS be on its own isolated network segment.Outputs: DVI-I Female, Serial DB9 Male, RJ45 Female, Dual RCA Audio FemaleFor general information, view Digital Signage Solutions view the product manual. andbull;The WDSDS system does not support devices that require HDCP. Examples include some Blu-ray and DVD Players. andbull;Some consumer level TVs only support certain resolutions like 480i, 480p and 720p. Only a digital HDMI or DVI sourceandnbsp;device should be used with the WDSDS transmitter when this type of TV is used. See the chart on page 12 of the manual for supported resolution information.andnbsp;',833.25,'Wireless','TruLink(R) Wireless Digital Signage Distribution System (WDSDS) Receiver','1 year','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',48,10,10,3,26,3.00,757.50),(29507,'757120295075','cable','This video coupler offers excellent picture quality for today\'s video and home theater applications. It is constructed with 24K gold plating that resists deterioration, and provides maximum corrosion resistance for low loss signal transfer. This coupler provides cable-matched 75 Ohm impedance to deliver an accurate picture, resolution and color. Yellow-coded for quick identification. Quickly connect two composite video cables to extend the overall length.Connector 1: One RCA FemaleConnector 2: One RCA Female',5.99,'Adapters or Connectors','75 Ohm RCA Video Coupler','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,2836,3.00,1.92),(29509,'757120295099','cable','Our aluminum hub conveniently adds four high speed USB 2.0 ports to your desktop or laptop computer. The slim form factor saves space while the port placement and hard-mountable metal base keep the hub in place even when several USB devices are connected. The removable aluminum base can be hard-mounted to your desk. The hub easily slides from that base, and makes it convenient for travel as well.This hub can be self-powered from the USB port, or utilize an AC power supply adapter (included). Downstream ports have automatic connect and speed detection plus overcurrent protection with auto recovery. Add additional hubs to daisy-chain up to 127 devices; this hub delivers high speed data transfers up to 480 Mbps.Whether you are downloading or transferring spreadsheets, MP3 files, digital pictures, or video streams, our 4-port hub makes connecting several high speed USB 2.0 devices hassle-free.Input: One 5V/2A Power Male and One USB Type Mini B FemaleOutput: Four USB Type A Female',42.99,'Retail Items','7-Port USB 2.0 Aluminum Hub','1 year','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,1303,3.00,37.82),(29513,'757120295136','cable','These audio couplers offer excellent sound quality for today\'s audio and home theater applications. They are constructed with 24K gold plating that resists deterioration, and provides maximum corrosion resistance for low loss signal transfer. Color-coded red and white for quick identification. Quickly splice together two pairs of composite audio cables.Connector 1: One RCA Female (each)Connector 2: One RCA Female (each)',5.99,'Adapters or Connectors','2-Piece RCA Dual Channel Audio Coupler','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,2262,3.00,2.02),(29524,'757120295242','cable','Want to put a window in your case but don\'t have the expensive power tools? Not to worry! Our nibbler tool provides a cost-effective way to get that case mod completed. Drill a pilot hole and let the nibbler tool do the rest. By modifying your old case with this affordable tool, you\'ll have money left over to add additional sound and video cards, cold cathode tubes, and LED fans! And you don\'t have to stop at case modding. Use the nibbler tool to cut shapes into any light gauge sheet metal, copper, aluminum, or plastic medium.Eliminate the need for expensive hand tools typically needed to install a window kit with this easy-to-use tool that will cut almost any size or shape hole. It\'s also useful for many other projects including making square holes for fuse holders, special connectors, displays, and more. And it\'s strong as it can cut through steel (up to 18 gauge), 1/16in aluminum, copper, plastic, or other unhardened metals.',12.99,'Testers, Tools','Nibbler Metal-Cutting Tool','1 year','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,101,3.00,9.69),(29526,'757120295266','cable','This precision-engineered cable is fully compliant with the DVI standard defined by DDWG (Digital Display Working Group). The DVI-I single link configuration provides enough bandwidth for resolutions up to 1600 x 1200 pixels and allows high speed transmission up to 4.95 Gbps. Three analog 30 AWG coaxial lines enable high speed analog transmission.Tri-shielded undermold and braid shield protects against unwanted EMI/RFI interference. Each coax line is individually wrapped in foam-polyolefin insulation and overwrapped with a braided tinned copper shield. 28 AWG copper conductors are individually insulated in hard-density polypropylene to minimize crosstalk, and ensure high-speed, error-free transmission. Gold-plated contacts provide full conductivity with no data loss. PC and Mac compatible cable supports hot-plugging of DVI display devices. PC-99 color-coded: white.Connector 1: DVI-I 23-pin MaleConnector 2: DVI-I 23-pin MalePlease Note: The DVI-I plug connector can only be inserted into a DVI-I interface.',42.99,'DVI and DisplayPort','5m DVI-I M/M Single Link Digital/Analog Video Cable (16.4ft)','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2