Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,137,3.00,56.03),(30501,'757120305019','cable','Click Here to See the FlexUSB Adapter video! The FlexUSB is the ideal solution for connecting your USB devices to your laptop, PC, or Mac(R). Use it with portable USB storage devices, CD/ DVD drives, MP3 players, wireless devices, external input, mice etc. Laptop work areas often have limited space such as airline tray tables, small coffee shop tables, or a person\'s lap. All these scenarios limit the user\'s ability to effectively connect one or more USB devices.With the FlexUSB adapter, you no longer need to worry about inconvenient locations or awkward orientation of your USB ports. This patent-pending, flexible adapter allows USB devices to plug into an open USB port from any angle. With +/- 90anddeg; horizontal and vertical hinges, you can connect your USB devices in a position most convenient for you. Ratcheting positions provide stability to hold the adapter in the position you desire. Get your FlexUSB adapter today and be on your way to simplifying your connections!Connector 1: USB Type A MaleConnector 2: USB Type A Female',22.99,'Retail Items','FlexUSB + trade, USB 2.0 A Male to A Female Adapter - Black','1 year','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,3089,3.00,11.62),(30504,'757120305040','cable','Turn any IDE or SATA drive into a convenient external drive! Simply connect one IDE/ATAPI or SATA-based mass storage device through a USB port to easily transfer files from a computer or laptop, backup files or store large file archives on an external hard drive. The USB 2.0 interface enables easy installation with its plug-and-play design. The adapter supports all existing IDE/ATAPI devices such as Iomega(R) Zip(R), CD-ROM, CD-RW, DVD-ROM and IDE hard drives. Compatible with current drive sizes on the market such as 1 and 2 TB SATA and 750 GB IDE drives.Because this adapter can handle all sizes and types of mass storage drives, it\'s a great solution for recovering personal files from IDE or SATA drives from computers that have had motherboard failures. Includes an integrated USB transceiver; supports USB Suspend/Resume and Remote Wakeup; and a 5 Volt (1 Ampere) power supply that supports both SATA power and standard 4-pin Molex (LP4) power connectors. Plus, the on/off switch on the power supply lets you shut off an attached drive without having to disconnect when not in use.Connector 1: USB Type A MaleConnector 2: 40-pin IDC Female (for 3.5in and 5.25in drives), 44-pin IDC Female (for 2.5in drives), 7-pin SATA Female (for SATA drives)',34.99,'Retail Items','33in USB 2.0 to IDE or Serial ATA Drive Adapter Cable','1 year','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,6441,3.00,26.88),(30505,'757120305057','cable','Use this manual switch\'s hot key functionality to use a keyboard to quickly switch between two computers. The LED port status indicator shows which computer is currently selected. Easily extend the number of USB devices shared by using a USB hub to daisy-chain up to 127 devices. Plug-and-play functionality makes installation a breeze. Input: Two USB Type BOutput: One USB Type A',32.99,'Retail Items','2-Port USB 2.0 Manual Switch','1 year','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,935,3.00,26.35),(30506,'757120305064','cable','Share a USB devices among four PCs or quickly extend the number of USB devices shared by using a USB hub to daisy-chain up to 127 devices. Hot key functionality enables use of a keyboard to switch among computers while the LED port status indicator shows which computer is selected. Plug-and-play functionality makes installation a breeze.Input: Four USB Type B, One USB Type A',42.99,'USB','4-Port USB 2.0 Manual Switch','1 year','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,115,3.00,37.78),(30510,'757120305101','cable','The Trulink(R) USB to HDMI(R) and VGA Adapter is a flexible solution for connecting laptops or desktops to monitors and/or displays using both analog (VGA) and digital (HDMI) signals.andnbsp; Connect both HDMI and VGA to view the same content across two displays using the included USB cable, while enjoying stereo audio through the HDMI and/or 3.5mm audio connection.andnbsp; The adapter supports primary, extended, mirror and rotated displays modes and allows for the addition of up to 6 displays with minimal configuration and without any additional graphics cards.andnbsp; Not only is the adapter simple to use and cost-effective, it\'s also bus-powered so an external power cord is not required. Its compact size also makes it portable so you can use it anywhere.Input:  One USB Mini B FemaleOutput: One HDMI Female, One VGA Female, and One 3.5mm Audio Female',122.99,'HDMI','Trulink(R) USB 2.0 to HDMI(R) and VGA with Audio','1 Year','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,513,3.00,106.30),(30513,'757120305132','cable','Click Here to See the FlexUSB video! This is the world\'s first USB A/B cable with a flexible connector! With patent-pending FlexConnexandtrade; technology, the FlexUSB cable can be used in difficult-to-reach and confined spaces. Don\'t worry about inconvenient locations or awkward orientation of your USB ports. The FlexUSB cable is the ideal solution for connecting your USB devices to your laptop, PC, or Mac(R) and to plug into an open USB port from any angle.Use it with portable USB storage devices, CD/ DVD drives, MP3 players, wireless devices, external input, mice etc. With +/- 90anddeg; horizontal and vertical hinges, you can connect your USB devices in a position most convenient for you. Ratcheting positions provide stability to hold the adapter in the position you desire. Get your FlexUSB cable today and be on your way to simplifying your connections!Connector 1: USB Type A Male (180anddeg; rotation)Connector 2: USB Type B Male',18.98,'Retail Items','6ft FlexUSB + trade, USB 2.0 A/B Cable','1 year','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,1948,3.00,6.72),(30536,'757120305361','cable','Replace your overused or misplaced power cable, AND keep the outlet open for other devices. This universal power cord is designed to work with most PCs, monitors, scanners, printers and other devices that use the 3-pin shroud power connector. Plus this heavy-duty 16 AWG cord features a fully molded design for maximum durability and long life.The female connector plugs directly into the device, and male connector plugs into a standard outlet while the additional grounded outlet on the male end allows you to use the outlet for other devices. Maximize your outlet usage!Connector 1: One 3-pin shroud Female (IEC320C13)Connector 2: One 3-prong grounded plug Male (NEMA 5-15P) and One 3-pin shroud Female (IEC320C13)',15.99,'Power cords and Surge','6ft 16 AWG Universal Power Cord with Extra Outlet','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,700,3.00,8.05),(30537,'757120305378','cable','Replace your overused or misplaced power cable, AND keep the outlet open for other devices. This universal power cord is designed to work with most PCs, monitors, scanners, printers and other devices that use the 3-pin shroud power connector. Plus this heavy-duty 16 AWG cord features a fully molded design for maximum durability and long life.The female connector plugs directly into the device, and male connector plugs into a standard outlet while the additional grounded outlet on the male end allows you to use the outlet for other devices. Maximize your outlet usage!Connector 1: One 3-pin shroud Female (IEC320C13)Connector 2: One 3-prong grounded plug Male (NEMA 5-15P) and One 3-pin shroud Female (IEC320C13)',12.99,'Power cords and Surge','1.5ft 16 AWG Universal Power Cord With Extra Outl