mum comfort and efficiency. Constructed from premium grade video cable, it uses a combination of coax and twisted pair to accommodate cable runs up to 100 feet away without a booster (in most cases), and without the typical distortion problems associated with extended length cabling runs. This cable is designed to hold the signal over greater distances without boosting or reconditioning. SXGA provides a screen resolution of 1280 x 1024 pixels. Not sure what resolution you need? See our VGA resolution guide.Connector 1:HD15 MaleConnector 2:HD15 MalePlease Note: Pin 9 is not loaded. Pin 9 is not required for standard computer video applications.',16.99,'VGA','1ft Premium Shielded HD15 SXGA M/M Monitor Cable','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,4495,3.00,7.01),(35567,'757120355670','cable','The TruLink(R) 4-Port VGA/USB 2.0 KVM offers a quick and easy way to eliminate clutter from your desktop. This switch allows you to control four computers with just one keyboard, mouse, and VGA monitor. Connect the switch to your computers via USB and VGA using the included cables. The two downstream USB 2.0 ports can be used to share USB peripherals. Two types of switching (push button and hot keys) enable you to operate the switch in the most effective way for your application.Input: Four HD15 Male and Four USB Type B FemaleOutput: One HD15 Female, Four USB Type A FemaleNote: This product is intended for use with standard (104 key or less), wired USB keyboards',137.99,'VGA','Trulink(R) 4-Port VGA/USB 2.0 KVM Switch','3 Years','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',80,10,10,3,518,3.00,132.79),(35568,'757120355687','cable','The TruLink(R) 4-Port VGA/USB 2.0 KVM with Audio offers a quick and easy way to eliminate clutter from your desktop. This switch allows you to control four computers with just one keyboard, mouse, VGA monitor, and speaker set. Connect the switch to your computers via USB and VGA using the included cables. The added audio feature lets you enjoy the audio from each of the connected computers as well. You can even listen to audio from one computer while you work on files from another! The two downstream USB 2.0 ports can be used to share USB peripherals. Two types of switching (push button and hot keys) enable you to operate the switch in the most effective way for your application.Input: Four HD15 Male, Four USB Type B Female, and Eight 3.5mm AudioOutput: One HD15 Female, Four USB Type A FemaleNote: This product is intended for use with standard (104 key or less), wired USB keyboards',199.19,'VGA','Trulink(R) 4-Port VGA/USB 2.0 KVM Switch with Audio','3 Years','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',96,10,10,3,560,3.00,181.08),(35667,'757120356677','cable','Our colored USB 2.0 cables combine functionality, performance, and value. Just plug-and-play for keyboards, mice, modems, printers, and other USB peripherals. Engineered to support high-speed USB computers and devices, this cable provides robust throughput of 480 Mbps, 40 times faster than USB 1.1. Foil and braid shielding reduces EMI/RFI interference and twisted-pair construction reduces crosstalk thus ensuring high-speed, error-free data transfer.Connect a USB peripheral to a USB hub or computer port and get high performance WITH flexibility. With different colors, you can easily color-code your USB devices, so you remember which device is connected to which port.Connector 1: USB Type A MaleConnector 2: USB Type B Male',14.99,'USB','2m USB 2.0 A/B Cable - Green','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,179,3.00,4.47),(35668,'757120356684','cable','Our colored USB 2.0 cables combine functionality, performance, and value. Just plug-and-play for keyboards, mice, modems, printers, and other USB peripherals. Engineered to support high-speed USB computers and devices, this cable provides robust throughput of 480 M