 color-code your USB devices, so you remember which device is connected to which port.Connector 1: USB Type A MaleConnector 2: USB Type B Male',42.99,'USB','2m USB 2.0 A/B Cables - 5 Colors - 5pk','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,54,3.00,13.09),(35700,'757120357001','cable','This adapter connects your USB keyboard or mouse to a PS/2 port on your computer. Simply plug this compact adapter into any PS/2 port, then connect your mouse or keyboard.Connector 1: USB Type A FemaleConnector 2: PS/2 MalePlease Note: The adapter only functions with items that are compatible with both USB and PS/2 signal types.',10.99,'USB','USB to PS/2 Adapter','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,2115,3.00,2.83),(36111,'757120361114','cable','This laser-optimized multimode fiber (LOMMF) cable provides backward compatibility with existing 50/125 equipment while providing the performance headroom required to support laser light sources and 10 gigabit applications. Optical Multimode 3 (OM3) fiber supports 2000 MHz/km EMB at 850nm, and provides 10 gigabit transfers up to 300 meters using an 850nm VCSEL source. Jacket is PVC (OFNR-rated).Connector 1: SC MaleConnector 2: ST Male',47.99,'Fiber Cables','1m 10 Gb SC/ST Duplex 50/125 Multimode Fiber Patch Cable - Aqua','Lifetime','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,34,3.00,36.78),(37007,'757120370079','cable','This Telco module provides high performance distribution for your telephone system. 110-style punchdown terminals for 4-pair wire allow as many as 4 lines to be distributed to 12 or more locations. Bridge modules together for larger systems.',62.99,'Wall Plates, Premise','12-Port 110 IDC Telephone Module','1 year','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,34,3.00,50.49),(37012,'757120370123','cable','Build a home network and reconfigure it as your needs change. Designed for use with our structured wiring panels, this module simply snaps into place. Terminate your CAT5E UTP wire to the 110 punchdown terminals, and then connect your router or hub with standard patch cables. This module enables you to share peripherals including multimedia servers, scanners, printers and your broadband connection with multiple locations.',52.99,'Cat5E / Cat6 Ethernet Cable','8-Port Cat5E Patch Panel','1 year','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,107,3.00,36.34),(37013,'757120370130','cable','This RF module is designed for easy snap-in installation in our structured wiring enclosures. It distributes CATV or off-air TV signals to 4 locations. Low loss and high isolation prevent external noise from interfering with the television signal. Works for digital and analog signals.Please Note: A video amplifier module may be required to enhance CATV or antenna signal strength.',15.98,'Wall Plates, Premise','4-way RF Splitter Module','1 year','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,69,3.00,12.19),(37015,'757120370154','cable','This RF module is designed for easy snap-in installation in our structured wiring enclosures. It distributes CATV or off-air TV signals to 8 locations. Low loss and high isolation prevent external noise from interfering with the television signal. Works for digital and analog signals.Please Note: A video amplifier module may be required to enhance CATV or antenna signal strength.',32.99,'Wall Plates, Premise','8-way RF Splitter Module','1 year','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,91,3.00,25.42),(37019,'757120370192','cable','This module is designed for quick and easy installation into our structured wiring panels. Amplify your off-air antenna or cable TV signal for long cable runs to distribute throughout your house. Improve signal quality for a bright, clear picture. Low noise amplifiers are ideal for amplifying the signal prior to long runs or connection to a splitter module.Bi-directional amplifiers are compatible to, and provide a return path for cable modems and video on demand services The 3X8 amplifier features two additional inputs for use with locally generated signals from RF modulators.',132.99,'Wall Plates, Premise','3 x 8 RF Distribution Amplifier Module','1 year','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',32,10,10,3,45,3.00,116.56),(37023,'757120370239','cable','This stereo volume control is ideal for use with whole house sound systems. Locate this 10-position swtich for output volume control within the room where the speakers are located for easy control of background sound levels. It\'s compatible with 8 Ohm in-wall, in-ceiling or free-standing speakers. 20 watts per channel capacity; screw terminals for easy connection. The off position removes volume control from the system.',42.99,'Wall Plates, Premise','20WPC Stereo Volume Control','1 year','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,78,3.00,37.15),(37027,'757120370277','cable','This amplified volume control is specifically designed for use with our four and eight zone audio distribution modules. The amplifier is built into the volume control and provides 10 Watts of power to each room! The selector button allow you to toggle through the four input devices connected to the distribution module. Connect volume controls via economical UTP cable. Four line level inputs at the distribution module.',67.98,'Wall Plates, Premise','4-Input Amplified Volume Control','1 year','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,67,3.00,50.55),(37035,'757120370352','cable','This 3.5mm keystone module snaps into standard keystone wall plates to allow you to connect IR emitters into the IR control system. Connect a 3.5mm cable from your PC sound card and playandnbsp;mono soundandnbsp;throughout your distributed audio system. 3.5mm modules are easy to connect to UTP cable; simply push the terminal and insert the wire.',7.99,'PC to TV','3.5mm 2-Conductor Keystone Adapter','1 year','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,31,3.00,2.55),(37036,'757120370369','cable','This 3.5mm keystone module snaps into standard keystone wall plates to allow you to connect IR targets into the IR control system. Connect a 3.5mm stereo cable from your PC sound card and playandnbsp;stereo soundandnbsp;throughout your distributed audio system. 3.5mm modules are easy to connect to UTP cable; simply push the terminal and insert the wire.',7.99,'PC to TV','3.5mm 3-Conductor Keystone Adapter','1 year','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,389,3.00,2.72),(37038,'757120370383','cable','RF amplifiers, hubs, routers and audio amplifiers require power ranging from 5 to 12 VDC for operation. Power supplies and outlet strips consume valuable space within the enclosure. Our DC power supply module provides 12 VDC, 7.5 VDC and 5 VDC regulated power for active devices. Overload and short circuit protection from a clean output power source with low ripple. Three fixed 12 VDC outputs and one switchable 7.5 or 5 VDC output for most DC-powered devices. Built-in EMI filter.',132.99,'Wall Plates, Premise','60 Watt DC Power Supply Module','1 year','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',32,10,10,3,38,3.00,108.78),(37041,'757120370413','cable','What will you do after you',5.98,'Wall Plates, Premise','Structured Wiring System Nylon Latches - 10pk','90 days','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,158,3.00,3.72),(37050,'757120370505','cable','Ready to work with multiple vendor\'s equipment, this patch panel is made for exceptional performance with black electrostatic powder-coated steel and 50 micron gold-plated contacts. Every panel comes with 110-type termination, while meeting and exceeding TIA/EIA-568-B Cat6 connecting hardware specifications. The clear numbering on both the front and back of each panel provides a quick, easy way to identify cable runs.Broken or damaged connectors are no longer a problem; you can quickly and easily replace them with Cables To Go keystone jacks. The high density 19-inch panel design lets you mount to any standard 19-inch rack or cabinet, accommodates top, bottom or side cable entry, and also saves valuable space in your rack. It also has a write-on designation label with a clear holder on the front and the rear.',102.99,'Cat5E / Cat6 Ethernet Cable','24-Port Cat6 110-Type Patch Panel','Lifetime','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,243,3.00,84.08),(37051,'757120370512','cable','Ready to work with multiple vendor\'s equipment, this patch panel is made for exceptional performance with black electrostatic powder-coated steel and 50 micron gold-plated contacts. Every panel comes with 110-type termination, while meeting and exceeding TIA/EIA-568-B Cat6 connecting hardware specifications. The clear numbering on both the front and back of each panel provides a quick, easy way to identify cable runs.Broken or damaged connectors are no longer a problem; you can quickly and easily replace them with Cables To Go keystone jacks. The high density 19-inch panel design lets you mount to any standard 19-inch rack or cabinet, accommodates top, bottom or side cable entry, and also saves valuable space in your rack. It also has a write-on designation label with a clear holder on the front and the rear.',167.99,'Cat5E / Cat6 Ethernet Cable','48-Port Cat6 110-Type Patch Panel','Lifetime','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',48,10,10,3,385,3.00,153.36),(37052,'757120370529','cable','Add the finishing touch to your home theater or clean up the array of computer cables in your office. This insert is stamped from 20 gauge steel and painted to match your room decor. Use it in standard electrical 