corative wall plates for easy installation. HD15 female DB-style feed-through connectors provide a secure connection for VGA cables. The 3.5mm jack on the front connects by a 3in pigtail to another jack for easier connection of your audio cable.Please Note: Fits standard electrical boxes and is compatible with Leviton Decora(R) brand wall plates. Decora(R) is a registered trademark of Leviton Manufacturing Company, Inc. This product is not manufactured or endorsed by the Leviton Manufacturing Company, Inc.',20.99,'VGA','Decorative HD15 VGA, 3.5mm Wall Plate Insert - White','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,978,3.00,14.08),(37092,'757120370925','cable','Add the finishing touch to your home theater or clean up the array of computer cables in your office. This insert is stamped from 20 gauge steel and painted to match your room decor. Use it in standard electrical boxes or mud rings, and with standard decorative wall plates for easy installation. HD15 female DB-style feed-through connectors provide a secure connection for VGA cables. The 3.5mm jack on the front connects by a 3in pigtail to another jack for easier connection of your audio cable.Please Note: Fits standard electrical boxes and is compatible with Leviton Decora(R) brand wall plates. Decora(R) is a registered trademark of Leviton Manufacturing Company, Inc. This product is not manufactured or endorsed by the Leviton Manufacturing Company, Inc.',20.99,'VGA','Decorative HD15 VGA, 3.5mm Wall Plate Insert - Ivory','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,812,3.00,14.08),(37093,'757120370932','cable','This stainless steel wall plate is designed with a plastic spacer that makes the keystone jack appear flush to the face. A variety of jacks and connectors will fill the wall plate openings to meet your specific requirements for voice, data, audio, video, fibe