t5 Extender is a robust solution that extends the distance from your KVM switch to your VGA monitor, PS/2 keyboard/mouse. Place your computers in one location and your console in another, up to 230 feet away. Driving the VGA and PS/2 signals over a Cat5E or Cat6 UTP patch cable lets you utilize your existing UTP cable infrastructure for a cost-effective and reliable installation.This solution is ideal for industrial applications (such as manufacturing lines, clean rooms, server rooms, training presentations, etc.) where your computers need to be placed in a secure or remote location and you need your monitor, keyboard, and mouse to reach further than the 25 feet length limitation experienced by most KVM switches. No software is required for this plug-and-play solution as it works with your existing VGA + PS/2 KVM switch.',215.78,'Retail Items','TruLink(R) VGA, PS/2 KVM over Cat5 Extender','3 Years','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,129,3.00,196.16),(39972,'757120399728','cable','Our UXGA Switcher/Extender allows you to display up to four computer audio/video outputs on one monitor or projector. Daisy-chain more than one switcher to expand the number of computers you can connect. With the built-in video signal enhancement, you can place the monitor up to 210 feet away while maintaining your video quality. No software is required and PC selection is easy.Switch between computers via push buttons or use the infared (IR) remote control up to six feet away. From use in test bench facilities, data centers and help desks, to classrooms, and multimedia centers, the TruLink Video Switcher/Extender delivers both performance and value. Input: Four HD15 Female and Four 3.5mm Female Output: One HD15 Female and One 3.5mm Female',162.99,'Retail Items','TruLink(R) 4-Port UXGA Monitor Switcher/Extender with 3.5mm Audio','3 years','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',32,10,10,3,112,3.00,130.20),(39973,'757120399735','cable','Our video/audio matrix switch i