me theater components. Silver-plated oxygen-free copper (OFC) twisted-pair conductors are purposely designed to deliver delicate audio signals with perfect fidelity regardless of the cable length!Our Cu Shielding Technologyandtrade; provides three layers of shielding for maximum isolation from EMI/RFI interference: two 80%+ OFC copper braids and one 100% overlapped foil.This state-of-the-art design eliminates environmental interference, and ensures astounding microdynamic performance coupled with amazingly quiet backgrounds. SplitLokandtrade; corrosion-resistant, 24K gold-plated connectors feature the use of precision-machined surfaces and a split centerpin for a solid, dependable electrical contact. Precise soldering techniques using expensive silver solder create increased electrical integrity, maximum signal transfer, long term reliability, and guarantee performance under the most demanding conditions.The Flexcableandtrade; ultra-flexible PVC jacket enables easy installation. Compare this audio interconnect with the offerings of any manufacturer at any price. You will find that, time and again, our sound engineering and thoughtful manufacturing processes create products that perform at the very limit of expectations!Connector 1: Two RCA MaleConnector 2: Two RCA Male',30.99,'Retail Items','1.5ft SonicWave + trade, Dual Channel RCA Stereo Audio Cable','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,208,3.00,18.17),(40085,'757120400851','cable','The Velocity HDMI cable delivers a strong combination of performance and value, and is a high performance home theater interconnect for high-definition DVD players, HDTV receivers, TV sets, projectors, a/v receivers, and other HDMI-equipped devices. Enjoy high-resolution digital video and true digital audio, delivered together in one convenient, compact connection. High quality materials and construction ensure a lifetime of dependable performance. Fully-sh