 scripts that allow for easy deployment across multiple controllers as room equipment changes. It also allows access to infrared (IR) programming capabilities, making programming via a remote control hassle-free. Firmware updates can also be made across multiple controllers without the need to remove from the wall.Connector 1: USB Type A FemaleConnector 2: USB Type Mini A MaleNote: Pins 4 and 5 are shorted on Mini A',8.99,'PC to TV','Trulink(R) Media Controller Administrator Key','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,600,3.00,4.37),(40347,'757120403470','cable','This USB adapter cable acts as the administrator key to allow access to certain functions within the Trulink Media Controller. This small cable unlocks powerful functions that save time and money. Within administrative mode, users can upload/download new equipment configuration scripts that allow for easy deployment across multiple controllers as room equipment changes. It also allows access to infrared (IR) programming capabilities, making programming via a remote control hassle-free. Firmware updates can also be made across multiple controllers without the need to remove the controller from the wall.Connector 1: USB Type A FemaleConnector 2: USB Type A Mini MaleNote: Pins 4 and 5 are shorted on Mini A',14.99,'PC to TV','Trulink(R) Media Controller Administrator Cable Key','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,1970,3.00,3.54),(40350,'757120403500','cable','This SMART Whiteboard Extension Cable connects the projector on the boom of the whiteboard to the Extended Control Panel or ECP. It extends the distance of the ECP (Extended Control Panel) from the whiteboardandnbsp;- allowing you to place it over 20 feet away. Now you can place the ECP near the teacher\'s desk in the classroom, conference room podium or wherever it is convenient for the user to connect their equipment to their SMART Whiteboard.Works with SMART models SB660i3, SB680i3, SB685i3, UF55 and UF55w. The cable is CL2-rated for in-wall installation.Connector 1: One HD15 Male, One DB25 FemaleConnector 2: One HD15 Male,andnbsp;One DB9 Male, One S-Video Male, One 3.5mm Male,andnbsp;Five RCA Male',6.97,'VGA','20ft SMART + trade, Whiteboard ECP Extension Cable','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',64,10,10,3,456,3.00,5.16),(40352,'757120403524','cable','This Decora(R)-compatible wall plate dresses up any home theater, conference room or classroom, and provides the final finishing touch to your audio/video installation. Unlike traditional pass-through wall plates, it is constructed by using four-layer computer grade printed circuit boards (PCBs).The PCB traces are engineered to maintain the critical impedance necessary to transfer the delicate digital signal. Made from 20 AWG steel, this strong wall plate fits standard electrical boxes, and is compatible with Leviton Decora(R) brand trim plates.Use the 3.5mm to run the audio using our line of DVI + 3.5mm cables. The dongle on the back will allow for your DVI installation to go where you need the cables inside the electrical box.Please Note: Decora(R) is a registered trademark of Leviton Manufacturing Company, Inc. This product is not manufactured or endorsed by the Leviton Manufacturing Company, Inc.',42.99,'Wall Plates, Premise','DVI + trade,, 3.5mm Decora(R) Pass-Through Wall Plate - White','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,392,3.00,28.04),(40353,'757120403531','cable','This wall plate dresses up any home theater, conference room or classroom and provides the final finishing touch to your audio/video installation. Unlike traditional pass-through wall plates, it is constructed by using four-layer computer grade printed circuit boards (PCBs).The PCB traces a