cable is shielded by a tinned copper braid providing a minimum of 85% coverage, and by aluminum foil and drain wire to provide 100% coverage.The low-smoke CMP-rated PVC outer jacket provide the fire protection required to run these cables within walls and air plenums without the need for conduit. Don\'t be misled by cable dealers selling low cost, so-called plenum cables that Don\'t meet the minimum requirements for plenum rating, those cables will cost you much more in the end. Instead, trust our plenum-rated high resolution cable for your installation!UXGA provides a screen resolution of 1600 x 1200 pixels. Not sure what resolution you need? See our VGA resolution guide.Connector 1:One HD15 Male and One 3.5mm MaleConnector 2:One HD15 Male and One 3.5mm MalePlease Note: Pin 9 is not loaded. Pin 9 is not required for standard computer video applications.',122.98,'VGA','15ft Plenum-Rated HD15 UXGA, 3.5mm M/M Audio Cable','Lifetime','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,114,3.00,70.68),(40686,'757120406860','cable','The ideal, high performance solution for video presentations, video projectors, plasma screens, LCD or CRT monitors, KVM switches, and in installations where the cable must perform over long distances. One 3.5mm male stereo plug on each cable end extends your audio source. The plenum rating is a necessity for any systems integrator working on an educational or commercial installation.Cable construction consists of three 75 Ohm 28 AWG coax cables plus three 26 AWG twisted pairs and two 26 AWG conductors ensuring signal integrity in your installation.The coax cables feature a tinned copper braid providing 93% shield. Besides the metal HD15 connector housing, the cable is shielded by a tinned copper braid providing a minimum of 85% coverage, and by aluminum foil and drain wire to provide 100% coverage.The low-smoke CMP-rated PVC outer jacket provide the fire protection required to run these cables within walls and air plenums without the need for conduit. Don\'t be misled by cable dealers selling low cost, so-called plenum cables that Don\'t meet the minimum requirements for plenum rating, those cables will cost you much more in the end. Instead, trust our plenum-rated high resolution cable for your installation!UXGA provides a screen resolution of 1600 x 1200 pixels. Not sure what resolution you need? See our VGA resolution guide.Connector 1:One HD15 Male and One 3.5mm MaleConnector 2:One HD15 Female and One 3.5mm MalePlease Note: Pin 9 is not loaded. Pin 9 is not required for standard computer video applications.',152.99,'VGA','15ft Plenum-Rated HD15 UXGA M/F Extension Cable, 3.5mm M/M Audio','Lifetime','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,43,3.00,104.38),(40697,'757120406976','cable','The ultimate controller for high definition and progressive scan video sources, this selector routes any of six source devices to each TV/monitor or one source to both TV/monitors. Connect all your HDTV products including DVD players, satellite receivers, cable set-top boxes, or gaming systems, and use the remote control or front panel buttons to watch any picture on any two plasma, CRT, LCD or projection televisions with complete independence!This matrix switch offers six component video inputs, six stereo audio inputs, and six optical digital audio TOSLINK inputs. It will switch all these inputs to either of the two outputs, with the audio following video. The matrix switch also comes with an infrared remote control that features discrete commands to make programming complex macros into your universal remote control system a snap. Compatible with all interlaced or progressive scan analog component video signals. Now you can take control of your system and watch what you want where you want, and do it with no compromises!Input: Six RCA Component Video Female, Six RCA Stereo Audio Female, Six TOSLINK FemaleOutput: Two RCA Component Video Female, Two RCA Stereo Audio Female, Two TOSLINK FemaleFor your convenience, the AC/DC Adapter (#98012) and the Remote Control (#98013) are available for this item. To order replacement parts, please call us at 1-800-506-9607.Please Note: This unit does not convert L/R audio to TOSLINK or TOSLINK to L/R audio.',202.99,'Retail Items','6x2 Component Video, Stereo Audio, TOSLINK(R) Digital Audio Matrix Selector Switch','1 year','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',96,10,10,3,684,3.00,154.55),(40698,'757120406983','cable','Our PC to TV Converter uses a state-of-the art chipset to produce a high-quality reproduction of your computer\'s video output on any TV or monitor utilizing standard s-video or composite video inputs. The converter accepts 640 x 480 pixels (VGA), 800 x 600 pixels (SVGA), and 1024 x 768 pixels (XGA) video signals from a PC, and converts them to NTSC or PAL signals that can be displayed on any standard TV or monitor.Simple to install, this converter is ideal for viewing slide presentations, browsing the web, PC gaming, and viewing pictures or movies that are stored on your PC, streamed from the internet or played through the computer\'s DVD player. The unit supports NTSC/NTSC-J/PAL systems with s-video and composite video outputs. A full-function remote allows users to zoom in/out, adjust vertical, adjust horizontal, flickering filter, color bars, and power. Powered from a standard USB port; two AAA batteries are required for the remote control.Input: One HD15 FemaleOutput: One HD15 Female, One S-Video Female, One RCA FemaleFor your convenience, the AC/DC Adapter (#98001) and the Remote Control (#98004) are available for this item. To order replacement parts, please call us at 1-800-506-9607.',110.99,'Retail Items','PC to TV Converter','1 year','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',32,10,10,3,705,3.00,109.50),(40699,'757120406990','cable','Audio/video distribution has become almost commonplace within the modern home. The TV is no longer relegated to a wheeled cart in the living room with a few guest appearances in the dining room; it has become a fixture of our time. As your distribution system grows, the cabling infrastructure within your home becomes more complex and, dare we say, unorganized.Our Decora-compatible rackmount can help you tame your distribution system. Simply install up to eight Decora-style wall plates per mount to create an easy-to-use audio/video patch bay. Switch your A/V sources and destinations quickly and easily. Manufactured from 18 gauge brushed aluminum and anodized to a black finish for years of usage. Fits standard 19-inch relay racks and cabinets; 3 rack units high (5.25in).Please Note: Not for use with electrical devices. This rackmount is intended for Low Voltage applications only! Decora(R) is a registered trademark of Leviton Manufacturing Company, Inc. This product is not manufactured or endorsed by the Leviton Manufacturing Company, Inc.',57.98,'Wall Plates, Premise','8-Port 3u Decora(R)-Compatible Rack Mounting Bracket','Lifetime','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,53,3.00,42.88),(40725,'757120407256','cable','RapidRun(R) is designed to be the standard for in-wall audio/video installations. The RapidRun system empowers you to customize your installation to create your own ideal audio/video solution. Break-away flying leads and wall plates ensure flexible, efficient, high quality connections for all types of equipment.Use this flying lead when a male HD15 connector is needed to connect to a PC, projector, or laptop. Whether hanging a projector in a classroom or installing a commercial digital signage system, a clean, crisp signal will be delivered every time.Please Note: Each complete RapidRun solution requires a break-away flying lead or wall plate to terminate each end of the runner cable. For each runner you will need (2) break-away flying leads, (2) wall plates, OR (1) break-away flying lead and (1) wall plate.',24.99,'RapidRun','1.5ft RapidRun(R) HD15 Male Flying Lead','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiippi