ng lead or wall plate to terminate each end of the runner cable. For each runner you will need (2) break-away flying leads, (2) wall plates, OR (1) break-away flying lead and (1) wall plate.',167.99,'RapidRun','15ft RapidRun(R) Plenum-Rated Multimedia Runner Cable','Lifetime','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,105,3.00,115.73),(40772,'757120407720','cable','Our plenum-rated cable is designed to meet stringent building codes for placement of low voltage wiring within a commercial building. The air space above a suspended ceiling or plenum is a common location for runs of low voltage cables. Placement of low voltage cables within the plenum require the installer to use materials that limit the release of smoke and fumes in the unfortunate event of a fire.This plenum-rated audio/video cable is constructed from three precision-machined 75 Ohm coaxial cables, and uses our precision-machined RCA connectors featuring our SplitLokandtrade; centerpins for a solid and reliable connection. A CMP-rated PVC cable jacket provide the fire protection required to run this cable within walls and air plenums without conduit.Each coaxial cable features a 26 AWG tinned copper center conductor covered by aluminum polyester tape and 92% tinned copper braid for 100% shield coverage.Connector 1: Three RCA MaleConnector 2: Three RCA Male',107.99,'Audio Video Cables','15ft Plenum-Rated Composite Video, RCA Stereo Audio Cable','Lifetime','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,42,3.00,80.85),(40800,'757120408000','cable','Our plenum-rated cable is designed to meet stringent building codes for placement of low voltage wiring within a commercial building. The air space above a suspended ceiling or plenum is a common location for runs of low voltage cables. Placement of low voltage cables within the plenum require the installer to use materials that limit the release of smoke and fumes in the unfortunate event of a fire.This plenum-rated audio/video cable is con