p;three stereo audio inputs, andandnbsp;three optical digital audio TOSLINK inputs. It will switch all these inputs to any of five outputs, with the audio following video. The matrix switch also comes with an infrared remote control that features discrete commands to make programming complex macros into your universal remote control system a snap. Compatible with all interlaced or progressive scan analog component video signals. Now you can take control of your system and watch what you want where you want, and do it with no compromises!Input: Back: Three RCA Component Video Female (x5),andnbsp;Two RCA Stereo Audio Female (x5), TOSLINK Female (x5) Front: Three RCA Component Video Female (x1), 3.5mm Stereo Audio Female (x1), TOSLINK Female (x1) Output: RCA Component Video Female (x2), RCA Stereo Audio Female (x2), TOSLINK Female (x5)For your convenience, the AC/DC Adapter (#98012) and the Remote Control (#98024) are available for this item. To order replacement parts, please call us at 1-800-506-9607.Please Note: This unit does not convert L/R audio to TOSLINK or TOSLINK to L/R audio.',232.99,'Retail Items','3x5 Component Video, Stereo Audio, TOSLINK(R) Digital Audio Matrix Selector Switch','1 year','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',112,10,10,3,632,3.00,221.36),(40992,'757120409922','cable','Quickly customize the length of your home theater or broadcast video cables with these BNC connectors. Nickel-plated brass provides years of reliable service. These connectors are a breeze to install and more reliable than traditional hex crimp BNC connectors. Plus the right-angled positioning enables a cleaner installation of your flat panel monitor. Simply prepare 3- or 5-conductor miniature coax cable using the stripping tool (item #40998), insert the centerpin and compress it with the 3-in-1 compression tool (item #38011).',10.97,'Adapters or Connectors','Right Angle Compression BNC Connector for Miniature Coax - 10pk','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after th