 RCA Stereo Audio FemaleOutput: Four RCA Component Video Female, Four RCA Stereo Audio Female',162.99,'PC to TV','4-Output Component Video, Stereo Audio Distribution Amplifier','90 days','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',32,10,10,3,46,3.00,137.64),(41074,'757120410744','cable','Quickly becoming the standard in satellite and cable television installation, our compression connectors provide reliable connections with a high resistance to moisture. High frequency, these are compatible with digital cable and satellite. The bright nickel finish withstands harsh environments, and reduces the effects of oxidation.An o-ring in the nut and a tapered plastic ferrule provide a barrier to moisture migration through the threads and under the cable jacket that would otherwise damage the cable. Use item #38011, our 3-in-1 compression tool, for easy installation.',13.99,'Adapters or Connectors','RG6 Compression F-Type Connector with O-Ring - 10pk','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,100,3.00,8.59),(41077,'757120410775','cable','Quickly becoming the standard in satellite and cable television installation, our compression connectors provide reliable connections with a high resistance to moisture. High frequency, these are compatible with digital cable and satellite. The bright nickel finish withstands harsh environments, and reduces the effects of oxidation.An o-ring in the nut and a tapered plastic ferrule provide a barrier to moisture migration through the threads and under the cable jacket that would otherwise damage the cable. Use item #38011, our 3-in-1 compression tool, for easy installation.',22.99,'Adapters or Connectors','RG6 Quad Compression F-Type Connector with O-Ring - 20pk','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,37,3.00,16.73),(41081,'757120410812','cable','This type of connector is commonly used for antenna, cable television and satellite television installations. Made from anodized brass to provide long life, free from oxidation. The nut on this connector is larger than that on most f-type connectors available, and that means more threads for better shielding, and a larger surface to finger-tighten the connector. Use item #38010, our RG6 crimping tool, for easy installation.',8.99,'Adapters or Connectors','RG6 Hex Crimp F-Type Connector - 10pk','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,60,3.00,4.37),(41082,'757120410829','cable','This type of connector is commonly used for antenna, cable television and satellite television installations. Made from anodized brass to provide long life, free from oxidation. The nut on this connector is larger than that on most f-type connectors available, and that means more threads for better shielding, and a larger surface to finger-tighten the connector. Use item #38026, our RG6 quad shield crimping tool, for easy installation.',8.99,'Adapters or Connectors','RG6 Quad Hex Crimp F-Type Connector - 10pk','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,34,3.00,4.37),(41084,'757120410843','cable','This type of connector is commonly used for antenna, cable television and satellite television installations. Made from anodized brass to provide long life, free from oxidation. The nut on this connector is larger than that on most f-type connectors available, and that means more threads for better shielding, and a larger surface to finger-tighten the connector. Use item #38010, our RG6 crimping tool, for easy installation.',12.99,'Adapters or Connectors','RG6 Hex Crimp F-Type Connector - 20pk','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,91,3.00,8.26),(41090,'757120410904','cable','This type of connector is commonly used for antenna, cable television and satellite television installations. Made from anodized brass to provide long life, free from oxidation. The nut on this connector is larger than that on most f-type connectors available, and that means more threads for better shielding, and a larger surface to finger-tighten the connector. Use item #38010, our RG6 crimping tool, for easy installation.',47.99,'Adapters or Connectors','RG6 Hex Crimp F-Type Connector - 100pk','Lifetime','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,33,3.00,37.04),(41106,'757120411062','cable','Distribute an HDTV/digital video signal from one a/v source to multiple TVs, monitors or receivers with this distribution amplifier. Daisychain amplifiers together for an unlimited number of TV connections without degradation to the picture quality! This amplifier supports cables runs up to 150 feet to provide maximum flexibility. Embedded unity gain technology ensures that the output signal is as clean as the input signal.High quality and stable signal conditioning eliminates the poor picture and sound quality you get by simply using y-cables. Use this amplifier with video sources such as DVD players or satellite receivers and with audio sources such as CD players and tuners for multizone sound systems. Ideal for nightclubs, banks, airports, boardrooms, and schools. The uses are endless!Input: One RCA Component Video Female, One RCA Stereo Audio FemaleOutput: Nine RCA Component Video Female, Nine RCA Stereo Audio Female',302.99,'PC to TV','9-Output Component Video, Stereo Audio Distribution Amplifier','90 days','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',64,10,10,3,34,3.00,217.49),(41116,'757120411161','cable','Quickly customize the length of your home theater or broadcast video cables with these connectors. Nickel-plated brass provides years of reliable service. Barbs within the connector centerpin provide a reliable signal path, and ensure a positive connection to the cable\'s center conductor. These connectors are a breeze to install and more reliable and easier to use than soldering RCA connectors.Simply prepare the cable in the same manner as an f-type connector, insert the connector onto the coax cable and compress it with the 3-in-1 compression tool (item #38011).',24.99,'Adapters or Connectors','RG59 Compression RCA Connector - 10pk','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,33,3.00,14.29),(41122,'757120411222','cable','Quickly customize the length of your home theater or broadcast video cables with these connectors. Nickel-plated brass provides years of reliable service. Barbs within the connector centerpin provide a reliable signal path, and ensure a positive connection to the cable\'s center conductor. These connectors are a breeze to install and more reliable and easier to use than traditional hex crimp BNC connectors.Simply prepare the cable in the same manner as an f-type connector, insert the connector onto the coax cable and compress it with the 3-in-1 compression tool (item #38011).',32.99,'Adapters or Connectors','RG59 Compression BNC Connector - 10pk','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,80,3.00,20.05),(41145,'757120411451','cable','Every installation technician has faced it or soon will - the dreaded hum bars on the screen, a telltale sign of a ground loop. Ground loops are caused by voltage potential differences at the ground point on your equipment. Voltages in the range of microvolts up to millivolts or higher can cause ground loops. Ground loops occur when multiple audio/video components are powered from different outlets, most commonly, outlets that are tied to different circuitbreakers or even a different secondary from the power transformer.Ground loops manifest themselves in the form of hum bars called herringbone (diagonal lines on the screen) and AC beat (a wide, barely visible bar that rolls from the bottom to the top of the screen). Often you can hear the ground loop as the noise on the video encroaches on the audio signal.Our isolation transformer easily connects into your audio/video system and breaks the ground path through cables between components. Start at the component last installed before the ground loop was discovered, and connect the isolation transformer at different ends of the audio/video cable until the ground loop is gone.Input: One RCA FemaleOutput: One RCA FemalePlease Note: While this transformer is designed to eliminate ground loops, isolating the source of the ground loop can be very difficult even for professional technicians. Sometimes the problem can be at the last added component or at the furthest from the main system; however, these might only be symptoms of a harder-to-solve problem. Please exercise patience as you work through test scenarios to eliminate your ground loop issue.',42.99,'PC to TV','Composite Video Isolation Transformer','Lifetime','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,437,3.00,31.40),(41146,'757120411468','cable','Every installation technician has faced it or soon will - the dreaded hum bars on the screen, a telltale sign of a ground loop. Ground loops are caused by voltage potential differences at the ground point on your equipment. Voltages in the range of microvolts up to millivolts or higher can cause ground loops. Ground loops occur when multiple audio/video components are powered from different outlets, most commonly, outlets that are tied to different circuitbreakers or even a different secondary from the power transformer.Ground loops manifest themselves in the form of hum bars called herringbone (diagonal lines on the screen) and AC beat (a wide, barely visible bar that rolls from the bottom to the top of the screen). Often you can hear the ground loop as the noise on the video encroaches on the audio signal.Our isolation transformer easily connects into your audio/video system and breaks the ground path through cables between components. Start at the component last installed before the ground loop was discovered, and connect the isolation transformer at different ends of the audio/video cable until the ground loop is gone.Input: S-Video FemaleOutput: S-Video FemalePlease Note: While this transformer is designed to eliminate ground loops, isolating the source of the ground loop can be very difficult even for professional technicians. Sometimes the problem can be at the last added component or at the furthest from the main system; however, these might only be symptoms of a harder-to-solve problem. Please exercise patience as you work through test scenarios to eliminate your ground loop issue.',47.99,'PC to TV','S-Video Isolation Transformer','Lifetime','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,43,3.00,37.73),(41147,'757120411475','cable','Every installation technician has faced it or soon will - the dreaded hum bars on the screen, a telltale sign of a ground loop. Ground loops are caused by voltage potential differences at the ground point on your equipment. Voltages in the range of microvolts up to millivolts or higher can cause ground loops. Ground loops occur when multiple audio/video components are powered from different outlets, most commonly, outlets that are tied to different circuitbreakers or even a different secondary from the power transformer.Ground loops manifest themselves in the form of hum bars called herringbone (diagonal lines on the screen) and AC beat (a wide, barely visible bar that rolls from the bottom to the top of the screen). Often you can hear the ground loop as the noise on the video encroaches on the audio signal.Our isolation transformer easily connects into your audio/video system and breaks the ground path through cables between components. Start at the component last installed before the ground loop was discovered, and connect the isolation transformer at different ends of the audio/video cable until the ground loop is gone.Input: Three RCA FemaleOutput: Three RCA FemalePlease Note: While this transformer is designed to eliminate ground loops, isolating the source of the ground loop can be very difficult even for professional technicians. Sometimes the problem can be at the last added component or at the furthest from the main system; however, these might only be symptoms of a harder-to-solve problem. Please exercise patience as you work through test scenarios to eliminate your ground loop issue.',97.99,'PC to TV','Component Video Isolation Tranformer','Lifetime','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,52,3.00,81.38),(41151,'757120411512','cable','This video balun provides an economical alternative to coaxial cable for video installations. It provides the necessary 75 Ohm impedance to a video device while providing 100 Ohm impedance to the cabling infrastructure. This balancing of impedances allows the video signal to travel with little to no degradation of signal up to 1500 feet over unshielded twisted pair (UTP) cable. Save installation time by sharing existing UTP network cable for video applications. The RJ45 female connector provides a quick method of connecting the balun to an existing UTP wall plate with RJ45 termination.Input: BNC MaleOutput: RJ45 Female',32.99,'PC to TV','BNC Male to RJ45 Female Video Balun','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,511,3.00,20.22),(41153,'757120411536','cable','This video balun provides an economical alternative to coaxial cable for video installations. It provides the necessary 75 Ohm impedance to a video device while providing 100 Ohm impedance to the cabling infrastructure. This balancing of impedances allows the video signal to travel with little to no degradation of signal up to 1500 feet over unshielded twisted pair (UTP) cable. Save installation time by sharing existing UTP network cable for video applications. The RJ45 female connector provides a quick method of connecting the balun to an existing UTP wall plate with RJ45 termination.Input: RCA MaleOutput: RJ45 Female',32.99,'PC to TV','RCA Male to RJ45 Female Video Balun','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,262,3.00,22.24),(41154,'757120411543','cable','This video balun provides an economical alternative to coaxial cable for video installations. It provides the necessary 75 Ohm impedance to a video device while providing 100 Ohm impedance to the cabling infrastructure. This balancing of impedances allows the video signal to travel with little to no degradation of signal up to 1500 feet over unshielded twisted pair (UTP) cable. Save installation time by sharing existing UTP network cable for video applications. The RJ45 female connector provides a quick method of connecting the balun to an existing UTP wall plate with RJ45 termination.Input: RCA FemaleOutput: RJ45 Female',32.99,'PC to TV','RCA Female to RJ45 Female Video Balun','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,172,3.00,21.91),(41155,'757120411550','cable','This video balun provides an economical alternative to coaxial cable for video installations. It provides the necessary 75 Ohm impedance to a video device while providing 100 Ohm impedance to the cabling infrastructure. This balancing of impedances allows the video signal to travel with little to no degradation of signal up to 1500 feet over unshielded twisted pair (UTP) cable. Save installation time by sharing existing UTP network cable for video applications. The IDC connector provides a quick method of connecting the balun to UTP cable without the need for expensive tools. IDC also provides the benefit of using multiple baluns to send up to 4 video signals over a standard 4-pair UTP cable.Input: BNC Male',37.99,'PC to TV','BNC Male to Toolless IDC Video Balun','Lif