c requirements of your installation.Please Note: Each complete RapidRun solution requires a passive break-away flying lead or passive wall plate on both ends of Runner cables up to and including 35 feet. For Runnersandnbsp;50 feet and longer, each solution requires a passive break-away flying lead or passive wall plate on theandnbsp;source end, and an active break-away flying lead or active wall plate on theandnbsp;display end to terminate the runner cable.',42.99,'RapidRun','1.5ft RapidRun(R) Digital DVI-D + trade, Passive Flying Lead','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,381,3.00,28.86),(42431,'757120424314','cable','RapidRun(R) is designed to be the standard for in-wall audio/video installations. The RapidRun system empowers you to customize your installation to create your own ideal audio/video solution. Break-away flying leads and wall plates ensure flexible, efficient, high quality connections for all types of equipment.The DVI-D + 3.5mm passive flying lead is the right complement for the Digital Runner when a wall plate is not required. It is most commonly used when connecting a PC to a monitor or projector. Whether hanging a flat panel TV in a home or installing a commercial   digital signage system, you can count on a crisp, clean signal up to   1080p and a clear stereo audio signal.When using the Digital Runner at lengths up to 35 feet, a passive flying lead or wall plate will be required on each end. When using the Digital Runner at lengths up to 100 feet, a passive break-away is required only at the source end. Terminate with flying leads (with lengths up to 10 feet), or with wall plates (available in three colors) to meet the specific requirements of your installation.Please Note: Each complete RapidRun solution requires a passive break-away flying lead or passive wall plate on both ends of Runner cables up to and including 35 feet. For Runners 50 feet and longer, each solution requires a passive break-away flying lead or passive wall plate on the source end, and an active break-away flying lead or active wall plate on the display end to terminate the runner cable.',50.99,'RapidRun','1.5ft RapidRun(R) Digital DVI-D + trade,, 3.5mm Audio Passive Flying Lead','Lifetime','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,174,3.00,35.78),(42437,'757120424376','cable','RapidRun(R) is designed to be the standard for in-wall audio/video installations. The RapidRun system empowers you to customize your installation to create your own ideal audio/video solution. Break-away flying leads and wall plates ensure flexible, efficient, high quality connections for all types of equipment.The DVI-D + 3.5mm active flying lead is the right complement for the Digital Runner when an active wall plate is not required. It is most commonly used in homes when connecting a PC to a monitor or for digital signage applications when the source is 50 feet or more away from the display. Whether hanging a flat panel TV in a home or installing a commercial   digital signage system, you can count on a crisp, clean signal up to   1080p and a clear stereo audio signal.When using the Digital Runner at lengths from 50 to 100 feet, an active flying lead or wall plate will be required on the display end. Terminate with flying leads (with lengths up to 10 feet), or with wall plates (available in three colors) to meet the specific requirements of your installation.Please Note: Each complete RapidRun solution requires a passive break-away flying lead or passive wall plate on both ends of Runner cables up to and including 35 feet. For Runners 50 feet and longer, each solution requires a passive break-away flying lead or passive wall plate on the source end, and an active break-away flying lead or active wall plate on the display end to terminate the runner cable.',252.99,'RapidRun','6ft RapidRun(R) Digital DVI-D + trade,, 3.5mm Audio Active Flying Lead','Lifetime','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,103,3.00,178.23),(42438,'757120424383','cable','RapidRun(R) Digital is designed to be the standard for in-wall digital audio/video installations. The RapidRun system empowers you to customize your installation to create your own ideal audio/video solution. Break-away flying leads and wall plates ensure flexible, efficient, high quality connections for all types of equipment. The DVI-I passive wall plate is the right complement for the Digital Runner when a clean, finished look is required. It is most commonly used when connecting a PC to a monitor or projector. Whether hanging a flat panel TV in a home or installing a commercial digital signage system, a crisp, clean signal up to 1080p resolution will be delivered every time. When using the Digital Runner at lengths up to 35 feet, a passive flying lead or wall plate will be required on each end. When using the Digital Runner at lengths up to 100 feet, a passive break-away is required only at the source end. Terminate with flying leads (with lengths up to 10 feet), or with wall plates (available in three colors) to meet the specific requirements of your installation. Please Note: Each complete RapidRun solution requires a passive break-away flying lead or passive wall plate on both ends of Runner cables up to and including 35 feet. For Runners 50 feet and longer, each solution requires a passive break-away flying lead or passive wall plate on the source end, and an active break-away flying lead or active wall plate on the display end to terminate the runner cable. This solution is design for digital signals only.',18.55,'RapidRun','RapidRun(R) Digital DVI-I + trade, Passive Wall Plate - Black','1 Year','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,25,3.00,16.86),(42439,'757120424390','cable','RapidRun(R) is designed to be the standard for in-wall audio/video installations. The RapidRun system empowers you to custom