es will cost you much more in the end.',8.99,'Bulk Cable','Bulk Plenum-Rated VGA Cable (UXGA Resolution)','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,32767,3.00,4.89),(43105,'757120431053','cable','With gigabit ethernet, broadband, audio/video and security capabilities, our Cat6 bulk cable is ideal for critical network installation. Use our stranded Cat6 to make jumper cables for use between network devices such as hubs, routers, NICs and patch panels.',132.99,'Cat5E / Cat6 Ethernet Cable','500ft Cat6 UTP 250 MHz Stranded PVC Cable - Blue','Lifetime','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',208,10,10,3,95,3.00,122.96),(43107,'757120431077','cable','With gigabit ethernet, broadband, audio/video and security capabilities, our Cat6 bulk cable is ideal for network installation in your home, office, or on the entire campus. Use our stranded Cat6 to make jumper cables for use between network devices such as hubs, routers, NICs and patch panels.',132.99,'Cat5E / Cat6 Ethernet Cable','500ft Cat6 UTP 250 MHz Stranded PVC CM-Rated Cable - Gray','Lifetime','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',208,10,10,3,279,3.00,122.96),(43112,'757120431121','cable','If you\'ve spent any time pulling cable, you',288.01,'Bulk Cable','Bulk Cable Roller and Dispenser','Lifetime','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',384,10,10,3,35,3.00,261.83),(43113,'757120431138','cable','Make installation of surveillance systems easier by carrying video over the 75 ohm coax and power over the 18/2! Dual shield RG59/U coax cable (75 ohm) features a 20 AWG solid copper center conductor for a truly clean video signal. 95% tinned copper braid over a foil shield protects the video signal from external EMI/RFI while providing a reliable path for PTZ signal control. Use for CL1, CL2, CM, CMX and CMG installations. Swept tested to 3 GHz to ensure performance. The cable jacket is sequentially marked every two feet to aid in tracki