ofessional look. It also reduces overheating by allowing more airflow inside your case. The flexibility of the floppy cable makes it easier to install than a flat ribbon cable.Plus, our molded round cable adds a little style especially for systems with windowed side panels.Besides providing floppy device control with a 3.5in floppy drive, this cable can also transfer data for older tape backup drives. Ideal for 1U servers and gaming/overclocked systems.Connector 1: 34-pin IDC FemaleConnector 2: Two 34-pin IDC Female',3.47,'Retail Items','24in Molded Round 2-Device Floppy Cable - Black','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,76,3.00,0.61),(50033,'757120500339','cable','Get the performance you need from your UDMA IDE drive. The slim cable\'s design saves internal space for increased airflow within your case to help reduce overheating. It also minimizes clutter and enables easy movement when adding or removing hard drives, PCI cards or other adapters. Plus, our molded round cable adds style and pizzazz especially to cases with windowed side panels.A high-speed UDMA interface allows host computers to send and retrieve data faster by removing bottlenecks associated with system performance. This 40-pin, 80-conductor Ultra ATA133 cable permits higher data transmission rates, reduces crosstalk, and improves signal integrity by providing 40 additional ground lines between the 40-pin IDE signal and the ground lines.Ideal for 1U servers and gaming/overclocked systems; supports Ultra 66/100/133 drives. Type-B cable type; connector layout has the blue connector for system, and the black connector for master.Connector 1: One 80-conductor/40-pin IDC FemaleConnector 2: One 80-conductor/40-pin IDC FemalePlease Note: Your burst rates may vary due to cable length, type of drive and controller used.',18.99,'Retail Items','24in Molded Round 1-Device Ultra ATA133 EIDE Cable - Black','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,220,3.00,7.72),(50035,'757120500353','cable','Get the performance you need from your UDMA IDE drive. The slim cable\'s design saves internal space for increased airflow within your case to help reduce overheating. It also minimizes clutter and enables easy movement when adding or removing hard drives, PCI cards or other adapters. Plus, our molded round cable adds style and pizzazz especially to cases with windowed side panels.A high-speed UDMA interface allows host computers to send and retrieve data faster by removing bottlenecks associated with system performance. This 40-pin, 80-conductor Ultra ATA133 cable permits higher data transmission rates, reduces crosstalk, and improves signal integrity by providing 40 additional ground lines between the 40-pin IDE signal and the ground lines.Ideal for 1U servers and gaming/overclocked systems; supports Ultra 66/100/133 drives. Type-B cable type; connector layout has the blue connector for system, and the black connector for master.Connector 1: One 80-conductor/40-pin IDC FemaleConnector 2: One 80-conductor/40-pin IDC FemalePlease Note: Your burst rates may vary due to cable length, type of drive and controller used.',12.98,'Retail Items','24in Molded Round 1-Device Ultra ATA133 EIDE Cable - UV Reactive Blue','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,463,3.00,5.14),(50039,'757120500391','cable','Get the performance you need from your UDMA IDE drive. The slim cable\'s design saves internal space for increased airflow within your case to help reduce overheating. It also minimizes clutter and enables easy movement when adding or removing hard drives, PCI cards or other adapters. Plus, our molded round cable adds style and pizzazz especially to cases with windowed side panels.A high-speed UDMA interface allows host computers to send and retrieve data faster by removing bottlenecks associated with system performance. This 40-pin, 80-conductor Ultra ATA133 cable permits higher data transmission rates, reduces crosstalk, and improves signal integrity by providing 40 additional ground lines between the 40-pin IDE signal and the ground lines.Ideal for 1U servers and gaming/overclocked systems; supports Ultra 66/100/133 drives. Type-B cable type; connector layout has the blue connector for system, and the black connector for master.Connector 1: One 80-conductor/40-pin IDC FemaleConnector 2: Two 80-conductor/40-pin IDC FemalePlease Note: Your burst rates may vary due to cable length, type of drive and controller used.',22.99,'Retail Items','36in Molded Round 2-Device Ultra ATA133 EIDE Cable - UV Reactive Blue','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,221,3.00,10.27),(50700,'757120507000','cable','IEEE-1394b is the latest in FireWire technology, and our IEEE-1394b or FireWire 800 cable provides transfer speeds up to a blazing 800 Mbps! This is twice the speed of the original 1394 standard, and is a real must-have for transporting and networking multiple types of digital data between users and systems. Digital Video (DV) camcorders, scanners, printers, videoconferencing cameras, and fixed disk drives can all share a common bus connection not only to a PC, but to each other as well.With Windows(R) ME(R) or Apple\'s FireWire Target Disk Mode you can use an IEEE-1394b cable to connect two computers together to enable filesharing.Hot-pluggable, our FireWire supports plug-and-play operation. This cable is designed to be 100% compatible with Apple(R) FireWire(R), Sony(R) iLink(R), and all other IEEE-1394b peripherals; also compatible with PC, Mac(R), Sun(R) and other IEEE-1394b equipped computers. Twisted pair cabling and shielded construction ensure our IEEE-1394b cable meets or exceeds current IEEE-1394b standards. Molded strain relief ensures years of trouble-free data transmissions.Connector 1: 9-pin 1394b MaleConnector 2: 9-pin 1394b MalePlease Note: FireWire(R) and the FireWire symbol are trademarks of Apple Computer, Inc., registered in the U.S. and other countries. The FireWire logo is a trademark of Apple Computer, Inc. This product is not manufactured or endorsed by Apple Computer, Inc.',30.99,'FireWire','2m IEEE-1394b FireWire(R) 800 9-pin to 9-pin Cable (6.5ft)','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,1345,3.00,19.20),(50701,'757120507017','cable','IEEE-1394b is the latest in FireWire technology, and our IEEE-1394b or FireWire 800 cable provides transfer speeds up to a blazing 800 Mbps! This is twice the speed of the original 1394 standard, and is a real must-have for transporting and networking multiple types of digital data between users and systems. Digital Video (DV) camcorders, scanners, printers, videoconferencing cameras, and fixed disk drives can all share a common bus connection not only to a PC, but to each other as well.With Windows(R) ME(R) or Apple\'s FireWire Target Disk Mode you can use an IEEE-1394b cable to connect two computers together to enable filesharing.Hot-pluggable, our FireWire supports plug-and-play operation. This cable is designed to be 100% compatible with Apple(R) FireWire(R), Sony(R) iLink(R), and all other IEEE-1394b peripherals; also compatible with PC, Mac(R), Sun(R) and other IEEE-1394b equipped computers. Twisted pair cabling and shielded construction ensure our IEEE-1394b cable meets or exceeds current IEEE-1394b standards. Molded strain relief ensures years of trouble-free data transmissions.Connector 1: 9-pin 1394b MaleConnector 2: 9-pin 1394b MalePlease Note: FireWire(R) and the FireWire symbol are trademarks of Apple Computer, Inc., registered in the U.S. and other countries. The FireWire logo is a trademark of Apple Computer, Inc. This product is not manufactured or endorsed by Apple Computer, Inc