h the dongle and wall plate versions allows for easy installation in tight spaces. The dongle end is uniquely designed to allow it to be securely tethered to other equipment, such as a whiteboard. Installation is quick and easy with no software or driver installation required - PC and Mac compatible.Base Connectors: One USB Type B Female and One RJ45 FemaleRemote Connectors: One USB Type A Female and One RJ45 Female',362.99,'USB','Trulink(R) USB 2.0 Superbooster Dongle Kit','1 Year','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',32,10,10,3,54,3.00,345.73),(53884,'757120538844','cable','Installing network devices in distant locations of a building can be a challenge since high voltage outlets may not be available. The implementation of a power injection/splitter provides a convenient solution for supplying both data and power over a single cable and connection to supported devices. The challenge exists when a power outlet or source is not easily accessible.The power injection/splitter adapter by Cables To Go is the solution for injecting power into the existing network cabling then splitting the power back out to connect to a device. Data and power can now be delivered to a single point to connect devices such as cameras, printers, wi-fi access points or VoIP phones.Please Note: The power injector/splitter adapter by Cables To Go is not intended for PoE-compliant devices. Please consult with your deviceandrsquo;s ownerandrsquo;s manual to ensure compatibility.',122.99,'Cat5E / Cat6 Ethernet Cable','Ethernet 48V Power Injector/Splitter','1 Year','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,186,3.00,93.61),(53928,'757120539285','cable','The 3.5mm stereo audio cable is specifically designed for quality computer audio applications. It connects a PC sound card, portable CD player or any mini-stereo audio device with 3.5mm jacks to a multimedia speaker. This cable features three copper conductors.andnbsp; Fully molded nickel-plated connectors provide excellent strain relief for durable use.Connector 1: 3.5mm Stereo MaleConnector 2: 3.5mm Stereo Male',3.45,'Audio Video Cables','6ft 3.5mm M/M Stereo Audio Cable Plenum','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,1059,3.00,0.59),(54000,'757120540007','cable','DisplayPort is a next-generation technology that delivers high bandwidth, pure digital audio/video signals from your PC to your display. Quality-made from 28 AWG copper wire, this cable is designed to deliver sharp, crystal-clear picture and sound, and is fully shielded to protect against EMI/RFI (Aluminum-wrapped, with a copper braid shield). Certified to DisplayPort 1.1 standards, it supports 10.8 Gbps, 12 bpc (bits per component), 36 bpp (bits per pixel), and has a 120 Hz refresh rate. Nickel-plated connectors; lifetime warranty. Connector 1: Molex (LP4) MaleConnector 2: Molex (LP4) MalePlease Note: 1.1 supports a single video source, and our DisplayPort cables and adapters support this specification. For reference, version 1.2, as it occurs in the future, will support multiple video streams for such devices that require the additional bandwidth.',30.99,'DVI and DisplayPort','1m DisplayPort + trade, 1.1 Cable with Latches','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,279,3.00,22.15),(54129,'757120541295','cable','This adapter converts a DisplayPort signal for viewing on a VGA-equipped display. Connect the adapter directly to the PC. Then use your VGA cable between the adapter and the display, and enjoy PC video content on virtually any VGA display. Features 8in dongle-style adapter, nickel-platedandnbsp;DisplayPort connector, molded VGA connector, 28 AWG copper wire, Aluminum shielding to protect against EMI/RFI.Connector 1: Oneandnbsp;DisplayPort MaleConnector 2: One HD15 FemalePlease Note: 1.1 supports a single video source, and our DisplayPort cables and adapters support this specification. For reference, version 1.2, as it occurs in the future, will support multiple video streams for such devices that require the additional bandwidth.',40.99,'DVI and DisplayPort','8in DisplayPort + trade, 1.1 Male to HD15 VGA Female Adapter Cable','Lifetime','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,4081,3.00,35.72),(54130,'757120541301','cable','This adapter converts a DisplayPort signal for viewing on a HDMI-equipped display. Connect the adapter directly to the PC. Then use your HDMI cable between the adapter and the display, and enjoy PC video content on virtually any high-definition digital audio/video display. Features 8in dongle-style adapter, nickel-platedandnbsp;DisplayPort connector, molded HDMI connector, 28 AWG copper wire, Aluminum shielding to protect against EMI/RFI. Supports full 1080p resolution.Connector 1:andnbsp;DisplayPort MaleConnector 2: HDMI FemalePlease Note: 1.1 supports a single video source, and our DisplayPort cables and adapters support this specification. For reference, version 1.2, as it occurs in the future, will support multiple video streams for such devices that require the additional bandwidth.This DisplayPort adapter operates passively and is designed for use with dual mode graphics cards often designated with andldquo;D++andrdquo;. HDMI audio is supported by this adapter when connected to a device that possesses dual mode and HDMI audio capability. Although the vast majority of source devices support HDMI with audio, some are incapable when using a passive adapter. If you are uncertain if your source device supports HDMI audio with passive adapters, please consult with your computer or graphics card manufacture to verify.',32.99,'DVI and DisplayPort','8in DisplayPort + trade, 1.1 Male to HDMI(R) Female Adapter Cable','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,283,3.00,25.42),(54131,'757120541318','cable','This adapter converts a DisplayPort signal for viewing on a DVI-equipped display. Connect the adapter directly to the PC. Then use your DVI cable between the adapter and the display, and enjoy PC video content on virtually any high-definition digital video display. Features 8in dongle-style adapter, nickel-platedandnbsp;DisplayPort connector, molded DVI connector, 28 AWG copper wire, Aluminum shielding to protect against EMI/RFI. Supports full 1080p resolution.Connector 1:andnbsp;DisplayPort MaleConnector 2: DVI-D FemalePlease Note: 1.1 supports a single video source, and our DisplayPort cables and adapters support this specification. For reference, version 1.2, as it occurs in the future, will support multiple video streams for such devices that require the additional bandwidth.This DisplayPort adapter operates passively and is designed for use with dual mode graphics cards often designated with andldquo;D++andrdquo;. Although the vast majority of source devices with DisplayPort are dual mode, it is recommended that you consult with your computer or graphics card manufacture to verify compatibility with passive adapters.',27.99,'DVI and DisplayPort','8in DisplayPort + trade, 1.1 Male to DVI-D + trade, Female Adapter Cable','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,10658,3.00,23.18),(54162,'757120541622','cable','This Mac(R)-Compatible adapter cable converts a Mini DisplayPort signal for viewing on a DVI-equipped display. Connect the adapter cable directlyandnbsp;to the computer. Then use your DVI cable between the adapter and the display, and enjoy computer video content on virtually any high-definition digital audio/video display. Supports full HD resolution (1080p @ 60 Hz).Connector 1: One Mini DisplayPort MaleConnector 2: One DVI-D FemalePlease Note: 1.1 supports a single video source, and our DisplayPort cables and adapters support this specification. For reference, version 1.2, as it occurs in the future, will support multiple video streams for such devices that require the additional bandwidth.',27.99,'DVI and DisplayPort','8.5in Mini DisplayPort + trade, 1.1 Male to DVI-D + trade, Female Adapter Cable','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,401,3.00,20.31),(54166,'757120541660','cable','Use this cable to connect video from a computer with a Mini DisplayPort source, like an Apple(R), HP(R), or Toshiba laptop, to a Mini DisplayPort display. Mini DisplayPort can driveandnbsp;resolutions up to 2560 andtimes; 1600 pixels, and is a common interface on many of the new Apple(R) computers. Connector 1: One Mini DisplayPort MaleConnector 2: One Mini DisplayPort Male',42.99,'DVI and DisplayPort','3m Mini DisplayPort + trade, 1.1 Cable (9.8ft)','Lifetime','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,246,3.00,31.81),(54167,'757120541677','cable','Use this cable to extend the reach of your current Mini DisplayPort cable. Mini DisplayPort can drive resolutions up to 2560 andtimes;1600 pixels, andandnbsp;is a common video interface on many of the new Apple(R) computers. Use this to extend video from a computer with a Mini DisplayPort source to a cable with a Mini DisplayPort connector.Connector 1: One Mini DisplayPortandnbsp;MaleConnector 2: One Mini DisplayPort Female',32.99,'DVI and DisplayPort','1m Mini DisplayPort + trade, 1.1 Extension Cable (3.2ft)','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,35,3.00,22.71),(54174,'757120541745','cable','Just plug-and-play for hard drive enclosures, printers, modems, cameras, and other SuperSpeed USB peripherals. This cable provides a transfer rate of up to 4.8 Gbps when connected with a USB 3.0 compliant host and device. Foil and braid shielding reduces EMI/RFI interference and twisted pair contruction helps reduce crosstalk thus ensuring SuperSpeed, error-free data transfer. Protective overmolded connector is color-coded blue to highlight USB 3.0 connectivity compatibility.Connector 1: USB 3.0 Type A MaleConnector 2: USB 3.0 Type B MalePlease Note: USB 3.0 (4.8 Gbps) provides TEN TIMES the capability of USB 2.0 (480 Mbps); it also provides up to 900 mA power instead of the 500 mA available with USB 2.0. Type A connections are backwards compatible to USB 2.0 and even USB 1.1. Finally, while USB 2.0 cables will work with USB 3.0 devices (at the lower USB 2.0 transmission speed and power), you won\'t enjoy the SuperSpeed of USB 3.0 without connecting with USB 3.0 cables!',16.99,'USB','2m USB 3.0 A Male to B Male Cable (6.5ft)','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,340,3.00,9.05),(54177,'757120541776','cable','Just plug-and-play for hard drive enclosures, printers, modems, cameras, and other SuperSpeed USB peripherals. This cable provides a transfer rate of up to 4.8 Gbps when connected with a USB 3.0 compliant host and device. Foil and braid shielding reduces EMI/RFI interference and twisted pair contruction helps reduce crosstalk thus ensuring SuperSpeed, error-free data transfer. Protective overmolded connector is color-coded blue to highlight USB 3.0 connectivity compatibility.Connector 1: USB 3.0 Type A MaleConnector 2: USB 3.0 Type Micro B MalePlease Note: USB 3.0 (4.8 Gbps) provides TEN TIMES the capability of USB 2.0 (480 Mbps); it also provides up to 900 mA power instead of the 500 mA available with USB 2.0. Type A connections are backwards compatible to USB 2.0 and even USB 1.1. Finally, while USB 2.0 cables will work with USB 3.0 devices (at the lower USB 2.0 transmission speed and power), you won\'t enjoy the SuperSpeed of USB 3.0 without connecting with USB 3.0 cables!',27.99,'USB','2m USB 3.0 A Male to Micro B Male Cable (6.5ft)','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,152,3.00,14.03),(54186,'757120541868','cable','Use this DisplayPort to VGA cable to connect a DisplayPort source directly to an HD15 monitor or display. The passive design will support a 1920 x 1200 @ 60 Hz with 12bit per color RGB color format. It contains automatic monitor plug and unplug detect for VGA output. Great for applications when you want to connect a newer laptop or desktop to an HD15-enabled display.Connector 1: DisplayPort MaleConnector 2:andnbsp;HD15 Male',52.99,'VGA','1m DisplayPort + trade, 1.1 Male to HD15 VGA Male Cable (3.2ft)','Lifetime','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,380,3.00,50.26),(54191,'757120541912','cable','Apple\'s latest iMac computers and LED Cinema Displays utilize a new type of video connector called Mini DisplayPort. This adapter cable converts a Mini DisplayPort signal for video and audio viewing on an HDMI-equipped display. Connect the adapter cable directly to the computer. Then use your HDMI cable between the adapter and the display, and enjoy computer video content on virtually any high-definition digital video display*. Supports full HD resolution (1080p @ 60 Hz).Connector 1: One Mini DisplayPort MaleConnector 2: One HDMI FemalePLEASE NOTE: MiniDisplayPort TO HDMI Adapter Audio pass-through has now been enabled for the following apple computer models:MacBook Pro 13/15/17andrsquo;andrsquo; mid-2010 release, iMac 21.5/27andrsquo;andrsquo; early-2010 release.Previous generation MacBook and iMac models only supports video output through miniDP.',32.99,'DVI and DisplayPort','Mini DisplayPort + trade, 1.1 Male to HDMI(R) Female Adapter Cable with Audio','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,441,3.00,27.68),(54200,'757120542001','cable','The Trulink Recharging Power Pack provides a convenient way to charge your mobile devices so you never run out of power again.andnbsp; Save time by eliminating the need to use standard power outlets to recharge electronics. This flexible device can be used anywhere, anytime your electronics need a power boost, even on airplanes.andnbsp; Perfect for travelers, the lightweight, compact design makes it easily carried and stored in a briefcase, laptop bag or even a purse.The recharging power pack is compatible with most handheld digital devices, such as mobile phones, digital music players, hand held game consoles, digital cameras, mobile tablets, e-book readers, and other portable electronics. This device functions as both a battery backup as well as a charger. Simply connect the power pack to your deviceandrsquo;s USB port and in no time your device will be fully charged. The power pack is durable and can be charged/recharged up to 500 times. Give your devices the power boost they need.Connector 1: USB Type A FemaleConnector 2: DC Power Plug',62.99,'USB','Trulink(R) Portable USB Rechargeable Battery (5000 mAh)','1 Year','Free Shipping','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,525,3.00,49.88),(54205,'757120542056','cable','Use this cable to connect video and audio from a computer with a Mini DisplayPort source, like an Apple(R), HP(R), Dell(R), or Toshiba laptop, to a DisplayPort display. Certified to Mini DisplayPort 1.1 standards, it supports 10.8 Gbps to support resolutions of up to 2560x1600, crystal-clear digital sound and has a 120 Hz refresh rate. Connector 1: One Mini DisplayPort Male Connector 2: One DisplayPort Male  Please note: This cable can only connect a Mini DisplayPort source to a DisplayPort display. It will not work with a DisplayPort source to a Mini DisplayPort display. These 1.1 DisplayPort cables support a single video source. For reference, version 1.2, as it occurs in the future, will support multiple video streams for such devices that require the additional bandwidth.',27.99,'DVI and DisplayPort','1m Mini DisplayPort + trade, to DisplayPort 1.1 Cable with Latches','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',16,10,10,3,420,3.00,19.24),(98015,'757120980155','cable','Two coupling rings are provided with every PC (yellow) and Multimedia (blue) RapidRun runner cable for connecting break-away flying leads or wall plates. This 2-pack is available to replace those rings that are lost or misplaced.Coupling Ring Use and Instructions:andbull; After installation, remove the pulling cap from the runner cable.andbull; Attach the coupling ring to the runner cable. Each end of the coupling ring has different threads. The knurled end will face away from the cable.andbull; Connect the break-away flying lead or wall plate to the runner cable via the coupling ring..',7.99,'RapidRun','RapidRun(R) Runner Coupling Rings - 2pk','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,687,3.00,3.77),(98033,'757120980339','cable','Use this item to replace a lost or damaged power supply for your UXGA splitter #29503, #29504, #29550, #29551, and #29552.',17.99,'KVM Cable, Switches','Replacement Power Supply for 29503, 29504, 29550, 29551, and 29552','1 Year','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,82,3.00,9.69),(98045,'757120980452','cable','Ideal for use with #40430, Infrared (IR) Remote Control Repeater Kit. Simply place this IR target to the front of your TV or any IR-controlled device. A 3.5mm plug connects to a three conductor, 3.5mm keystone jack for connection into your IR system. The 10 foot cable allows you to move the target to a position best suited to receive the IR signals from your remote control. Connect via economical UTP cable; 12V DC operation is compatible with common IR devices. You can even control audio/video devices located behind doors or in other rooms!',34.99,'PC to TV','10ft Dual Band Infrared (IR) Receiver with 3.5mm Plug','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,188,3.00,25.01),(98070,'757120980704','cable','The replacement AC/DC adapter is available to power the Trulink A/V Controller when the original adapter is lost or damaged.andnbsp; Please note that the Trulink A/V Controller can be powered through the Trulink Audio Amplifier (P/N: 40100) using optional DC power cables.',17.99,'PC to TV','Replacement AC/DC adapter for TruLink A/V Controller','1 Year','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,111,3.00,9.72),(98071,'757120980711','cable','The replacement Multiport Controller Interface Adapter (MCIA) provides quick, secure connections for the Trulink A/V Controller.andnbsp; Specifically engineered for use with this controller, the MCIA provides connections for A/C power adapter, RJ45, DB9, and two IR cables.andnbsp; The MCIA also contains dip switch controls for toggling between modem and null modem connections.',22.99,'PC to TV','Replacement Multiport Controller Interface Adapter (MCIA)','1 Year','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,115,3.00,12.97),(98073,'757120980735','cable','The replacement key plate provides secure seating for the 8 programmable buttons of the Trulink A/V Controller. Each button slot is numbered for easy identification and operation, particularly when programming the controller upon installation or equipment upgrades.andnbsp; The key plate also includes a USB On-the-Go (OTG) port with a protective cover as well as the infrared port with a protective cover.',7.99,'PC to TV','Replacement Key Plate','1 Year','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,150,3.00,1.27),(98074,'757120980742','cable','The replacement 2-position receptacle is the terminal block available to replace lost or damaged blocks that ship with the Trulink A/V Controller.andnbsp; This terminal block is the mate for IR#2 output on the MCIA.',7.99,'PC to TV','Replacement Two Position Receptacle','3 Years','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,100,3.00,1.27),(98075,'757120980759','cable','Use this 6ft DC power cord (#98075) to supply power to the Trulink AV Controller. Add flexibility to the installation by powering the Controller from the Trulink Audio Amplifier (#40100) or an alternate power source to save an Additional AC outlet from use. Specifically designed to easily connect to the AV Controllers Multiport Controller Interface Adapter, the power cord is a 5.5mm x 2.1mm DC Barrel plug to stripped and tinned wire. This provides a secure power connection that will remain firmly in place to ensure consistent and reliable performance of the AV Controller.',7.99,'PC to TV','DC Power Cord for TruLink A/V Controller','1 Year','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,50,3.00,3.08),(98078,'757120980780','cable','The replacement key sheet allows users to replace lost or worn buttons for their Trulink A/V Controllers.andnbsp; This 36-button sheet provides text and icon identification for key functions (such as on/off, volume up/down, etc.) and audio video equipment types (DVD, PC, Document Camera, etc.)',10.99,'PC to TV','Replacement Rubberized Key Sheet','1 Year','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,197,3.00,5.17),(98083,'757120980834','cable','The blank key sheet allows users to place extra blank buttons in their Trulink A/V Controllers. This 6-button sheet provides extra buttons as needed for customers who need more than the one blank button per installation.',10.99,'PC to TV','Blank Rubberized Keys','3 Years','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,198,3.00,5.17),(98084,'757120980841','cable','The replacement infrared emitter cable is used with the Trulink A/V Controller and is used to replace the lost or damaged IR Emitter Cable that ships with the unit.andnbsp;',15.99,'PC to TV','Replacement IR Emitter Cable','Lifetime','Qualify for Free shiipping after the total order is more than $30','2012-06-01 15:27:51','tom',0,10,10,3,178,3.00,8.45),(98085,'','USB','<li>Travel charger adapter allows charging at home or in the office via USB cable connection.  </li>\r\n<li>Simply plug in the USB cable, and plug the adapter into the wall.</li>\r\n<li>LED charging indicator light shows charging status.</li>\r\n<li>Intelligent IC chip inside recognizes a full battery and automatically switches to a saver mode to prevent overcharging and short circuit.</li>\r\n<li>Compact, lightweight, portable, stylish, easy to store.</li>\r\n<li>Perfect accessory for traveling.</li>\r\n<li>Input: 100V - 240V (U.S. & World Standard), LED light power indicator.</li>',2.99,'iPod, iPhone, MP3 Items','Wall AC Usb Charger for Iphone and Ipod','It is brand new, so it has the manufacture warranty. We also offer refund warranty if you don\'t like the product in 30 days. ','Free shipping','2012-07-14 16:53:41','tom',2,7,2,10,10,1.95,2.76),(98086,'','Generic','<dl>\r\n<dt><h3>Compatible With:</h3></dt>\r\n<dd>Windows 2000, Me, XP, Vista, Win 7, Mac and Linux Ubuntu</dd>\r\n<dt><h3>Features:</h3></dt>\r\n<dd>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>2.4GHz wireless transmission up to 10 meters operating distance.</li>\r\n<li>With 6 Keys, including Scroll Wheel, Page Forward and Page Backward buttons for easy Internet Surfing.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install, plug-and-play.</li>\r\n<li>Comfortable grip.</li>\r\n<li>800/1600dpi, cursor speed adjustable.</li>\r\n<li>With On/Off power switch.</li>\r\n<li>Low power consumption.</li>\r\n<li>Micro-receiver.</li>\r\n<li>Ideal for laptop and desktop.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</dd>\r\n<dt><h3>Specifications:</h3></dt>\r\n<dd>\r\n<ul><li>USB: USB 2.0</li>\r\n<li>Operation systems: Windows 2000, Me, XP, Vista, Win 7 and Mac</li>\r\n<li>Power: 2pcs AAA battery (not included)</li>\r\n<li>Color: as shown in the picture</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</dd>\r\n<dt><h3>Package Included:</h3></dt>\r\n<dd>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1 x 2.4GHz Wireless Portable Optical Mouse</li>\r\n<li>1 x USB receiver</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</dd>\r\n</dl>',9.99,'Computer Mouse','New Wireless Mouse plus USB 2.0 Receiver for PC Laptop or Desktop with 6 buttons','It is brand new. We also offer refund warranty if you don\'t like the product and return it in 14 business days. Buyer pays the return shipping fee.','Free shipping','2012-10-18 03:16:37','thomas',3,3,1,2,5,1.95,6.55),(98087,'','Cisco','<dl>\r\n<dt><h3>Compatible With:</h3></dt>\r\n<dd>Windows 2000, Me, XP, Vista, Win 7, Mac and Linux Ubuntu</dd>\r\n<dt><h3>Features:</h3></dt>\r\n<dd>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>2.4GHz wireless transmission up to 10 meters operating distance.</li>\r\n<li>With 6 Keys, including Scroll Wheel, Page Forward and Page Backward buttons for easy Internet Surfing.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install, plug-and-play.</li>\r\n<li>Comfortable grip.</li>\r\n<li>800/1600dpi, cursor speed adjustable.</li>\r\n<li>With On/Off power switch.</li>\r\n<li>Low power consumption.</li>\r\n<li>Micro-receiver.</li>\r\n<li>Ideal for laptop and desktop.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</dd>\r\n<dt><h3>Specifications:</h3></dt>\r\n<dd>\r\n<ul><li>USB: USB 2.0</li>\r\n<li>Operation systems: Windows 2000, Me, XP, Vista, Win 7 and Mac</li>\r\n<li>Power: 2pcs AAA battery (not included)</li>\r\n<li>Color: as shown in the picture</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</dd>\r\n<dt><h3>Package Included:</h3></dt>\r\n<dd>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1 x 2.4GHz Wireless Portable Optical Mouse</li>\r\n<li>1 x USB receiver</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</dd>\r\n</dl>',9.99,'Computer Mouse','New Wireless Mouse Plus USB 2.0 Receiver for PC Laptop or Desktop with 6 buttons','It is brand new.  We also offer refund warranty if you return the product in 14 business days. Buyer pays the return shipping fees. ','Free shipping','2012-10-18 03:46:31','thomas',3,3,1,2,25,1.95,6.55);
